<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="no" ?>
<FinalDraft DocumentType="Script" Template="No" Version="6">

  <DocumentRef DateTime="20250719T225100" id="311bf653-30ed-4d65-a49b-1d9bc7012bab">
    <XRef DateTime="20250719T224917" id="326d3bbb-277d-4966-b8b4-fc0c38660087"/>
  </DocumentRef>

  <Content>
    <Paragraph Type="New Act" id="5c27492e-c03e-4a50-8c99-ad9c114c1b65">
      <Text Style="Underline+AllCaps">Prologue: Lab-Grown Meat</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Info" id="af681496-bc4f-416e-bc09-1ed582588156">
      <Text>Scene 1</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="db89851c-ac8b-40a2-b40e-8c5fb1062e3a">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 5/8" Page="1" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="GOBI">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="JACA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Laboratory</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3d87f7db-9dae-4a34-b370-3aca87fa85db">
      <Text>2060. Afternoon.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3d87f7db-9dae-4a34-b370-3aca87fa85db">
      <Text>The standard workspace hums with machinery. There are vats with lab-grown meat around.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4a6f97c7-ac7a-4d8c-9de3-41090dc2ba87">
      <Text>60-something-year-old Gobi is supervising, a veteran scientist who has just taken on a new charge. Jaca is a 20-year-old bright, enthusiastic Marrow Designer intern, wearing a lab coat and safety goggles.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b375e804-1f58-4bf8-a4f0-c08014075f0c">
      <Text>GobI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="48ca6970-bf6a-4d1e-8fb2-7e2eb7d28e93">
      <Text>Whopper? Do they still call it a whopper?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="17e4bd4e-b300-40ae-99ee-b16a447f258f">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7564c3a3-3f9e-4882-a1a8-86f2b5c01508">
      <Text>Do they still call you all boomers?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="cc2b8a80-57a5-4c15-9f35-e6656579f4b1">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="063766db-f056-424f-a358-5cb2fe2f6e05">
      <Text>I expect nothing more from a mindless intern.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b6f36c83-39cd-4f7d-b28e-3c8ac89fa249">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="02722599-758c-4113-b803-401723a54c98">
      <Text>Your mindless intern!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a8cb61e8-9645-4abb-965f-b404880c8b02">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f8315b88-0bf1-460b-bfaa-cc071a2332e8">
      <Text>You’re dense.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0aa88f0f-e1a5-46e1-99e3-7838936c3f93">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="02722599-758c-4113-b803-401723a54c98">
      <Text>The bovine density levels are stabilizing perfectly, Dr. Gobi! We're at 1.0. This procedure is ready to try during the Harvest. A perfect Harmonic Disc on the fiftieth try!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3f02958f-aaa6-45ab-8670-88933792a183">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5545fb85-1544-4c3e-bc00-d74fc416b603">
      <Text>The cells are finally... compliant.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="eae2d8c5-47cc-4232-bbfb-81009f9898a2">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5461e040-7c48-4cab-ab34-9c96d157ddfc">
      <Text>Our blood cells no longer feel like jail cells. My father said the air on the ground used to hurt his lungs. I can't imagine a world like that.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c121810d-4943-49d7-80eb-28fbc312c8a4">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="efeb68bf-8619-4f37-9ed1-ca3d74a82835">
      <Text>It was heavy. A different kind than this.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4b2636bf-2779-48e9-bc46-aefa087e332c">
      <Text>Gobi taps the glass of the vat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ce2ec35f-d7e2-46db-ab6c-4dc2f6b486cc">
      <Text>Gobi</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2a66187c-6b54-4fe8-8090-3a1c5dfe8e54">
      <Text>We did a good thing, kid. We traded the slaughterhouse for the foundry. This... this was supposed to be the miracle.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="deda9957-6527-45d0-acd7-f1dea3406703">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="98c2c5d5-c0d4-43fc-be67-72a863ade674">
      <Text>And it is! “Mercy with Every Bite.” Our CEO's favorite slogan. This will be the standard for the next harvest.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="64fd8777-340b-44db-a0b4-a034f52b800f">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="-0.10" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.00" RightIndent="5.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Parenthetical" id="52fe35a4-5e65-4c7d-9e8a-849a3175d975">
      <Text>(to themself)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d415e2c5-b4a7-4792-8003-3fc3ba0141f1">
      <Text>Mercy is a heavy word with no backbone.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="-0.10" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.00" RightIndent="5.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Parenthetical" id="203b688c-995e-497e-a437-9833acbdf118">
      <Text>(to Jaca)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4176273a-32c9-41d1-8902-5b4d0a5daa11">
      <Text>Just make sure you log the texture data correctly. They want to ensure it has no "Texture Aggression."</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="377207b7-0cf7-4742-936b-6a90fa615304">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c9090117-fb78-4197-8365-c7b4ec15ddea">
      <Text>It'll be perfectly smooth. The algorithm guarantees a soft bite. No drama, just good tech and clear air. And a juicy chicken wing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="90923336-6bc8-4432-89d4-419c7801752b">
      <Text>Jaca starts entering data. Gobi pauses for a moment, then reaches into their pocket and briefly touches a worn photograph of a cow in a field before returning to work. The hum of the machine continues.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="724bc9cb-213b-4ea8-8d51-ee3799329588">
      <Text>Black out.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Info" id="af681496-bc4f-416e-bc09-1ed582588156">
      <Text>Scene 2</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="96a32d7a-55f4-4d84-85c0-a92fc67c00ce">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 3/8" Page="2" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="GOBI">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="JACA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Park</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0c2bbeb2-1e4b-4286-8d5c-03adb1a9a84d">
      <Text>2060. Morning.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3692303b-74c3-48a9-8ca1-a2f0446583fe">
      <Text>A pristine park with lush trees. Jaca and Gobi are jogging at a moderate pace.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="59d475df-428b-4511-9235-738675945110">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="-0.10" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.00" RightIndent="5.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Parenthetical" id="824d376c-0eb4-440a-83f7-80a4115e46e8">
      <Text>(Breathing heavily)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e99325fe-74c2-4181-8f71-e411f01868ba">
      <Text>Air tastes good today.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="260b04e1-1fef-47bb-b6a8-1c50cd66d6ec">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="-0.10" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.00" RightIndent="5.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Parenthetical" id="b9ef6ef8-a8a4-49e4-92bb-3fcb4e649f4a">
      <Text>(Breathing harder)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6911ae23-6555-4bfd-a426-e3da58affbea">
      <Text>It's... efficient.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="afbc19e4-bb92-492d-968e-71389bb5e15b">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d6779a7b-7c58-4725-9ca0-a012caf48767">
      <Text>You okay? That's barely a slope.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5c81a2d9-013a-450b-8061-12bc0a85aa00">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6bc9608b-a5d9-47f7-8881-865c8842e887">
      <Text>The bones in my legs are not what they used to be. Lab-grown chicken wings... how about human legs?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a7de5deb-6980-4b91-880d-7f93eca56023">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7a14423c-2415-46f1-b01d-e4358d916b7e">
      <Text>The 2030s called. They want their lactic acid back. The rumor is they're close to a new regeneration protocol. A patch, maybe? Slap it on, no soreness, ready for tomorrow's run.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5e6cf906-67df-4a7f-a03e-a1d7a9afaf64">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="cacf144f-a1e1-45d4-a59a-ffe2ac3dc92b">
      <Text>A patch? Sounds like you're trying to engineer the satisfaction right out of the effort.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="34fa9143-891a-43c3-8cfd-d6967f3a81ba">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b2fa2828-b238-49d8-849b-8d1b1609558b">
      <Text>I heard they're even hoping to regrow a full arm with it someday. No more prosthetics. Just perfect, clean, new flesh. A miracle made real.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="add5dd29-a813-4dcd-8f3f-1fa8778f26f1">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d221453c-6713-41e2-88fc-25b385506ead">
      <Text>A new arm. A new leg. A seamless, clean absence of trauma.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b004bb22-c2c0-4cfc-96c6-fc94decdce31">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7577dcf4-6510-40d7-8ac9-8b04f9a42d8c">
      <Text>Exactly. My dad used to cough through half his day due to the polluted air. That was a liability. This air, this park... It's the Great Peace made real.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0a152563-0ecd-49c2-8cf4-ee5b48a605d4">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ef48cb04-44d7-4eff-85be-d492105b68cb">
      <Text>There's a difference between not having to think about a cost, and forgetting it entirely. You forget the cost, you forget the value.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2bb93045-5d84-4c27-960c-99cc560d6054">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0077c486-3635-44c4-b250-9c33b05e6193">
      <Text>Anyway. We should pick up the pace. We're on the clock for the lab. The future waits for no one, you know.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="6378f8e2-7339-4374-907d-4d5d88913cea">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3841cd28-fc79-4337-9d03-67d3bd9a232b">
      <Text>Let the future weigh on you.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9ce917bd-df6b-4f03-b236-1c0ccb1ce69f">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="63066e1b-d723-4e6a-ba96-b04cf9419590">
      <Text>I wonder when medicine will give us wings?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="671464a0-b763-421f-970f-f91155982bf2">
      <Text>They jog off into the distance. The hum of the nearby city machinery is audible.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="aa3c8ee8-6303-48d3-8a12-f8ea0ca3ed39">
      <Text>Black out.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="End of Act" id="08536e41-1a30-4a93-a2de-c23282464060">
      <Text Style="Underline+AllCaps">End of Prologue</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="New Act" id="5c27492e-c03e-4a50-8c99-ad9c114c1b65">
      <Text Style="Underline+AllCaps">Act I: The Chicken Wings Preliminary</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Info" id="af681496-bc4f-416e-bc09-1ed582588156">
      <Text>Scene 1</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="1f62d9b0-9b12-444c-8f3a-86461cdc5a79">
      <SceneProperties Length="11 6/8" Page="5" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ANNOUNCER">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="GOBI">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="JACA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>The kitchen Arena</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3df605a5-dd71-468c-9525-ee5ab7413ed2">
      <Text>June 21, 2063, almost noon.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f3785035-a444-4c5a-a8ca-d8b829e8901e">
      <Text>We are at The Final Harvest, a global, live-streamed cooking competition, celebrating the 40th anniversary of lab-grown chicken wings. The mood is celebratory and optimistic.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="67740f42-1200-4139-97e3-2f98063b7a6a">
      <Text>On center stage is Bioreactor </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">XY</Text>
      <Text>, a massive translucent cylinder with levers and a tablet. If all goes well, it would soon hold a chicken wing. Above is the Jumbotron, which flickers with corporate logos, view counts, updates on every contestant, and chicken memes.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2de6f9b9-e2f9-4dcf-9d67-b8a272fba733">
      <Text>Two pools of light on stage. On one side, 24-year-old Jaca is by the bioreactor. Nearby, 60-something-year-old Gobi meticulously polishes a set of holographic knives.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f2d24ba6-b1a9-4b96-b195-984f362b716d">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="c3546caa-ee13-4d24-8e6c-2c5da3f4bfba">
      <Text>(to the audience)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="831b38d0-9271-41d6-a881-0c28bb050310">
      <Text>They ask me why I want the Bio-License. They think it’s about the money. But they don't see the air. By 2063, the Great Peace has been our finest achievement. The pastures are forests again. We've seen a seventy percent drop in methane emissions and a ninety percent reduction in water usage globally because we stopped mass livestock breeding. No one wakes up hungry. We traded the slaughterhouse for the foundry, and the Earth breathed back. We don’t eat meat. We consume mercy. I am a Marrow Designer, the architect of the weightless feast. I'm going to grow a world where nothing ever has to die to be delicious. I am the future, and the future is perfectly, beautifully-</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b915daf3-6b6c-44ed-9ef8-e3b93b6a70d4">
      <Text>GoBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="1f3323ea-f0ef-497e-976f-2c2c0d42f956">
      <Text>(to the audience)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="66f97e6f-9af9-4e49-831a-0bc4ef3b56c6">
      <Text>Spineless! They call it Cloud Protein. I call it memory loss. 2063 is a sponge, absorbing history and calling it “optimization.” My mentee thinks they’re designing a miracle. I’m just here to make sure the miracle has a backbone. Even if I have to break the machine to do it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f46d981e-8ae9-4e7b-95db-bd1f8e3061ed">
      <Text>Announcer (V.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="bc29adde-d88e-4208-a21f-8e90314a3291">
      <Text>Let us celebrate the Cloud Protein: a revolutionary, lab-grown meat alternative cultured from a single cell, requiring no traditional livestock farming! It's the present and future of guilt-free dining!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f47d7f50-81a4-400c-b1b4-0867245ffd62">
      <Text>Music plays.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f41a98f7-6514-4d9b-a64a-920211ababca">
      <Text>Lights go blinding neon. A massive bass drop shakes the room.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f46d981e-8ae9-4e7b-95db-bd1f8e3061ed">
      <Text>Announcer (V.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4a022333-d255-42ba-a169-307d9378fdb1">
      <Text>Citizens! Welcome to the preliminaries of... The Harvest! Forty years ago, the lab-grown chicken wings ere born.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2fa0a30f-f759-431b-aee6-6ef07beadc50">
      <Text>Gobi</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="743fde98-8791-48e1-a146-3db85377ab15">
      <Text>Lab-grown abominations...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0f3e137f-52c3-4b88-800c-4865dd399355">
      <Text>ANNOUNCER (V.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6f21f2d2-6c23-490e-b71d-5f84e8e65bb1">
      <Text>Tonight, two generations unite or clash! Will the legacy hold, or will the cloud rise? Your sixty-minute wing assembly starts... now!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8d62554b-af21-402f-8574-6d9eb5334842">
      <Text>The Jumbotron timer snaps to 59:59. The light in the arena shifts to red. Jaca lunges for the terminal console. Gobi crawls out of the maintenance hatch, grease-stained and defiant.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8f9a5b9c-de77-4b2f-9a1c-fd2bff171f64">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="90fe2917-d673-458b-9b09-b5e7a382c04c">
      <Text>Gobi! The Floor Manager is screaming! We’re live! Why are you still in the hardware port?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9d09ef17-00fe-46e8-8ef4-6e8ef4b0f275">
      <Text>GoBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9cff1a37-895f-4c35-a3b4-77652dc6c94e">
      <Text>I’m busy reminding this biomass that it used to have an anatomy, Jaca.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c978dfa0-d82d-4220-966f-b9f422e3ffe3">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="52b8f902-7075-4b2d-bfb1-d16e5dc98a43">
      <Text>Is that... is that a bone? Gobi! This is a televised arena! We’re supposed to present the Meatless Wing. If the judges see structural debris on the primary scan-</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="235ed414-64c2-4dbc-bef1-67362a694784">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="912ae45c-1759-477e-bd22-ce7840f6fbeb">
      <Text>It’s an avian rib. 2023 variant. I’m giving the viewers some history to chew on.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0e9c7590-615c-4384-b861-321d60551926">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f4536cb2-977f-4888-b523-251543f167ea">
      <Text>Darn dad jokes... </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Anywho</Text>
      <Text>, it’s a design flaw! We’re the Cloud Protein generation. If you put a hard object in that vat, you’ll be the first contestant in history disqualified for aggressive Geometry. You’ll snap the judges' veneers!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="98796dfa-c5b4-40e0-802e-03ec4f3ce6c0">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c8afcffa-b312-4ce8-93a8-9da7a46e6ce4">
      <Text>Forty years ago, people liked the "fight" of a meal. Now, you’re trying to win a license by serving meat with the personality of a wet napkin.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0ffd9067-29fd-4440-8105-7f690bb7ed3c">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0ec9e9d5-12df-44f9-9060-91060baff6d0">
      <Text>I have the official recipe-lock! We’re supposed to be flushing the scaffold logic to make room for the 2013 London Burger finale. We’re going Pure-Fluid, Gobi! That’s how we win the license and get out of this foundry!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0b08dfe9-9d3b-4f22-8aab-1aa8283ac5ee">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="45885cf8-56c8-432f-9b6b-6798c875050d">
      <Text>The "Pure-Fluid" wing just failed, Jaca. I spiked the nutrient-mix with high-density calcium. It turned into a puddle of expensive gray soup at 0400 hours. The only thing in this building that stayed upright... was my bone.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4449d60c-0c52-4e3b-945f-af4194bb707c">
      <Text>A beat of pure terror.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="91bf4df9-42fc-4693-9880-16a76c45cd20">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0f297a2d-19e4-4941-a4c1-648ab902a62e">
      <Text>You sabotaged our preliminary? On a global feed? Ten minutes ago you were my mentor. The one who was gonna perfect my legacy! Now look at you—you’re a biological terrorist!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e492b304-71a7-45eb-993c-5ddc226feb8d">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5b3a6237-7043-4798-bc25-30a208d21846">
      <Text>I’m a cultivator. I’m forcing you to show the world a spine.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="31695b31-5801-4565-ac85-30dfff255342">
      <Text>Jaca</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a9184e21-90fe-4bcc-80ee-3ae775302020">
      <Text>The sensors are already red-lining. The algorithm doesn’t know how to map a solid, Gobi! It thinks the rib is a tumor. Look at the Cloud. It’s shivering! It’s trying to vomit the foundation back out of the nutrient mist.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="afefec39-883b-4f66-bc91-6c6485ac1307">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2e4ca26f-10ae-4a04-8942-b8acf935341e">
      <Text>It’s not shivering. It’s breathing. It’s forty years deep into a Meatless lie, Jaca. Let it be heavy for once. If the Cloud wants to be a wing, it has to learn how to wrap itself around the truth.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6a67ee13-3fc1-4587-ab8a-b595bce11a48">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6e21c038-08ac-4b91-94e3-85a851f88ce3">
      <Text>I have a mortgage in the Breathing Zones! My father’s oxygen-debt is three months overdue. I don’t have the luxury of "the truth." I just need the harvest to stay upright long enough to get us into the Golden Jubilee.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="40e47a59-77ec-4054-8f59-98de4405635c">
      <Text>A low-frequency </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">thud</Text>
      <Text> vibrates the floorplates. On the Jumbotron, the density-graph spikes into the red. The timer reads 45:00.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5cde92eb-2954-46ec-99db-dfa1fe98d15a">
      <Text>ANNOUNCER (V.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="58f7f960-f37d-4cad-a398-963dc0c3d3bc">
      <Text>Forty-five minutes remaining! The 2023 wing is showing... Unexpected mass. Is this a leap forward, or a collapse in the making? Viewership has just cleared six billion!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a9c16995-eb20-4e65-ba19-d6c8451ed729">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="f2053412-357c-471b-8a1f-3d003a3a099f">
      <Text>(to the vat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0ec37d31-d6cf-46f8-8943-a08961e23034">
      <Text>Stabilize! Damn you. If the acoustic fields invert now, this whole room becomes a pressure cooker. We’ll be seared into the assembly before the judges even arrive!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="777725f7-d548-4edc-9780-e5b6bb1b238f">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1f556376-2e74-4c5f-b2c0-3c280ce456fe">
      <Text>It won’t. It’s finally eating, Jaca. Look at the vascularity. It’s threading through the calcium. It’s... it’s nostalgic.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2ee40bfb-f57d-4fe2-9d71-50b27e0818bc">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f582f76a-bb45-4205-af67-24eec58b71f0">
      <Text>It’s a biohazard! The CEO is pinging my ocular feed right now. They’re seeing the “Legacy” signature. They want a remote safety-purge before the drones lock on!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ca1f9814-3751-4769-adff-63f277657faf">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d7c4b9e7-359d-49b1-bde4-727990fe1f8a">
      <Text>Tell the CEO that if they cut the power, they’re murdering the most “telegenic” harvest in history. Look at the metrics. They don’t want a Meatless Wing. They want to see if the ghost can breathe.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="63d1c4a2-7b37-4198-8eb9-b00db422f0b3">
      <Text>The lights in the arena cycle through a rapid, clinical white. The Jumbotron snaps to a close-up of the vat. The Cloud Protein is no longer a mist; it is a dense, throbbing amber mass, tightly bound to the avian rib.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2d65b5f0-53ae-4b67-ba37-880dbe684ee8">
      <Text>ANNOUNCER (V.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="bdebd916-e30f-422a-8f82-98a68f67a78e">
      <Text>Thirty minutes remaining. Judges are hungry. Don't let the cloud collapse! The chicken wing is pulsing! We have a biometric signal! Is it alive, or is it... Lunch?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="01be52c4-78aa-4d0b-a270-74b954048933">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ec754366-99b6-44a5-b477-5df352b07326">
      <Text>The density is at 1.4. It’s over-calcifying, Gobi! The rib is acting as a heat-sink. If we don’t bridge the thermal-regulator, the protein will sear from the inside out before the harvest-bell rings.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e1a919c1-5030-4558-a31d-fff6d301f79f">
      <Text>Gobi rips open a maintenance kit on the floor.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="79c0e166-be06-450f-9fd3-cdf28411380c">
      <Text>GoBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e8ad6c63-f7a8-4087-88ee-e31f0d54888f">
      <Text>Then we bridge it. Give me the sensors.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e1772e7c-cb2a-4e6f-9c4a-b1840d3e98a4">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e7b011d4-1dc1-4186-9e67-0c34a9b9c43d">
      <Text>Gobi, if you link your pulse to that machine, you’ll be blacklisted. You’re throwing away forty years of "Clean" science. You’ll never work in a bio-foundry again!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8685d159-fc6c-414f-8012-8075661080d3">
      <Text>Gobi tapes the sensor to their arm.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8b839734-4f20-406e-8ed3-b09098c59fcc">
      <Text>GobI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6fa8c0cc-5afc-449d-93c2-fe5b797ecd59">
      <Text>I’m not throwing it away, Jaca. I’m giving it a heartbeat. Look at the view-count. Six billion people aren't watching for the protein. They're watching to see if we bleed.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="cd66cff6-0854-450b-ba00-1fdac54a44b4">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e893d688-762d-451d-8733-c56ec609d25a">
      <Text>They’re watching because they want to see us fail!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0ffa7fa3-f0e2-4da8-b69c-7d4990c30c5e">
      <Text>GoBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="bddbbc74-ebd4-417c-9306-6d9331e1ac85">
      <Text>No. They’re watching because for the first time in their lives, they’re looking at something that has a price.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="56e87803-1889-47cb-8a90-264b3c2ba6a4">
      <Text>Gobi offers the secondary patch.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f5c4e0a9-7c5a-4f3b-a41d-d7c1e2f3574a">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c47c80c5-39a5-4f5a-b237-33b35d4e5939">
      <Text>Link in, Marrow Designer. Stop polishing the future and start holding the foundation.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f5a4f2cd-19f1-4c71-886c-2c37b5dffe12">
      <Text>Jaca looks at the patch, then at the glowing, shivering vat. With a jagged, desperate motion, they rip open their sleeve and slap the sensor onto their forearm. A resonant </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">thud</Text>
      <Text> vibrates the floorplates as the two heartbeats synchronize. The vat flares with a brilliant, unified gold.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d3e9e628-2d92-45de-a5ae-a1e97f1b38ea">
      <Text>JaCA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6989b889-35fd-4ccd-ba79-29c28a614e02">
      <Text>It’s... it’s softer.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c657126a-689c-4bbd-b8c1-9ac344082ba5">
      <Text>GobI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="bc7b7a26-ba8f-4cba-9a42-d8ad1294b717">
      <Text>Look at the Cloud. It’s finally... raining.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1d65381d-a28e-40a4-9cb8-36e133b01d17">
      <Text>Jaca is frantically swiping a holographic interface, attempting to override </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Gobi’S</Text>
      <Text> manual calcium injection. Gobi stands guard over the maintenance hatch, arms crossed, blocking the thermal sensors.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b78da02c-2fca-40a9-8bb3-4e737742b287">
      <Text>The golden light from the Bioreactor begins to bleed into the clinical white of the kitchen. Jaca is still tethered to the console, their breathing synchronized with the pulsing meat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e53201b6-c19b-4eb3-913a-61e052442659">
      <Text>Jaca</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="25ed7251-7352-4acd-9733-160ec912f412">
      <Text>(to the vat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="bc9618d8-85e3-407d-9c2f-bde6623d6574">
      <Text>Steady. Twenty-five minutes until the judges sink their teeth into a moral dilemma. The density is stable at 1.0. Perfect. Absolutely perfect.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ca7e3664-9643-4430-b869-39aec5e8bc81">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="e83d3885-c13b-4261-afb6-840caa8a84a1">
      <Text>(placing their head on the vat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3bbf7fc7-c015-40f0-86e7-b0da48b10bd3">
      <Text>It feels like a drum solo. I can taste the difference already. It’s got... conviction. It’s not just growing anymore, Jaca. It’s striving.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="02a0e970-5640-4820-b802-44df1c27d467">
      <Text>Jaca checks the haptic feedback.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1a98ce24-d2dc-4026-a722-5174f44f4384">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="07566c6a-86d4-42d7-bc48-b025cfc960bf">
      <Text>The Ruby rib is becoming a heat-sink. It’s pulling the excess thermal energy from your link. You aren't just giving it a pulse, Gobi; you’re giving it an oven.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="fca2834d-a5ac-4722-aa3a-386a742de01f">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="53227b12-5039-4b25-8896-877492864e38">
      <Text>It’s the first time in my life I’ve felt the "cost" you keep talking about. It’s not a line on a spreadsheet. It’s a literal burn in my arm.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e5668de6-cc87-4885-a475-a1c96b947c3e">
      <Text>A beat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c96d1493-53b7-499a-9410-0d368c2ccbc7">
      <Text>GoBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="53227b12-5039-4b25-8896-877492864e38">
      <Text>Do you think they’ll know? When they bite?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="543a1eb5-d8e0-4338-9bc0-110bb9969413">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d0f1dea8-92bd-432f-ae4b-3d073058b0a2">
      <Text>The tongue doesn’t lie. You can code the texture, but you can’t simulate the resistance. They’ll feel the 2023 approval date. They’ll feel the day the cages opened. They’ll feel... us.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ccd963c4-424a-484a-91e2-681953446d6c">
      <Text>A sudden, violent glitch on the overhead screens. The logo of the Bio-Foundry flickers, replaced by a wall of scrolling red text: "PROTOCOL BREACH. UNAUTHORIZED BIOMETRIC LINK."</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0a3316b7-01af-4f5f-91ff-68b2b6f1d54a">
      <Text>GoBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="726d82a2-7eeb-4f95-ae98-7cb4a7db6e88">
      <Text>The CEO is trying to initiate a remote "Safety Purge." They’re claiming the </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">EKG</Text>
      <Text> link is a contamination of the product. They’re trying to dump the vat before we hit the twenty-minute mark!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a430728f-29aa-470b-a2b8-03e36e4c5202">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="698c0492-bd1d-4f50-b1c2-792e17410aeb">
      <Text>Let them try. I’ve slaved the acoustic levitation to our shared pulse. If they purge the vat, they purge our signal. We’ll flatline on a global feed.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8d854a8a-0780-43b3-b382-92480d33ce51">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="dc47d83a-9d6e-4c3e-b952-9e88c3c746e2">
      <Text>You’re holding the broadcast hostage.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="805d4629-229b-4668-8b7e-6f4439c9fc34">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d4d3c72f-9f76-4f07-9709-7d0c3e90c969">
      <Text>I’m ensuring the harvest.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2962cc00-d9ee-46e6-98ba-58a4fe6c7ea4">
      <Text>Gobi’s fingers become a blur on the holographic keys. They are no longer a "Marrow Designer" following a recipe; they are a hacker rewriting the future.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8fd79ee6-3aa4-4ff1-8d96-44813ad76d15">
      <Text>GobI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e1a59fb3-bc2e-40ff-bf9d-543b06af7aad">
      <Text>I’m overriding the Foundry’s outbound data. I’m slaving the </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">EKG</Text>
      <Text> monitor to the main Jumbotron. If he wants to see who’s in this room, I’m going to show him.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6f8bf33b-40ce-4220-b593-694c43c3ab9f">
      <Text>The overhead monitors snap into a thumping </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">EKG</Text>
      <Text> display. Two hearts, one rhythm. The holographic audience in the rafters goes silent for a split second, then erupts.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6cacc8a7-5cfa-4c91-8ecf-ef63220ed2d4">
      <Text>ANNOUNCER (V.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c840a23d-779a-43e0-a682-332a6e1bdab8">
      <Text>Whoa! A last-minute swap of the visuals! It seems our contestants are offering up a... Biometric experience! Twenty minutes remaining! The kitchen is heating up! The judges are ready to mingle with the meat!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="bd3bdeba-00e5-4652-af03-c7d9542bd040">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="655f4b47-960b-4b5b-85e5-8bcfb2a58aa5">
      <Text>Look at the pings, Gobi. They don’t want the "Meatless Wing." They want the heartbeat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="53a248f6-35a9-4343-a988-16f663fd20ca">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="313b17d3-4d6b-42b1-b20e-13fe33e94340">
      <Text>Then let’s give them the Ruby.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c8bd7d14-addf-4711-8461-8a0f05938d7b">
      <Text>The kitchen is no longer a room; it is an echoing chamber of red-lining alarms and the frantic, rhythmic thumping of the Jumbotron </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">EKG</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="fd820f09-f1a4-4f41-8afa-8c0f99b58df3">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ba1d3af3-8f9e-4536-ba51-bcb4fb0b454f">
      <Text>The density... it’s hitting 1.5. Gobi, the protein is becoming too rigid. If it hits 1.6, the Ruby rib will shatter. We’ll be serving the judges a mouthful of calcified shrapnel.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0103627b-e65c-42f7-ac6a-6b5312bfcac2">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d8a7fcf3-459a-4d29-acab-a39c2182c8d6">
      <Text>I’m dropping the acoustic pressure! I’m trying to soften the binding, but the CEO’s override is still tugging at the valve! He wants it to shatter! He wants to prove that "Bones" are a safety hazard so he can bury the Legacy department once and for all.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7d7a11af-afc2-4749-a769-1d205f798ea2">
      <Text>ANNOUNCER (V.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b46b2043-ccaa-41e4-9d75-8ebd86406c14">
      <Text>Fifteen minutes remaining! The heartbeat is steady, but is the wing? We’re seeing structural stress! The cloud is fighting the foundation!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8eab074b-3f62-44d3-9997-d90d122a29ad">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ebbdd813-76b8-415c-af53-897325bc4c79">
      <Text>They don’t understand... that you can’t have a harvest... without a risk. Gobi, look at the marbling. It’s perfect. It’s the 2023 spec. If we can just hold it for fifteen more minutes...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="cb1017a0-cfa2-4941-8763-7b01d1fb2c50">
      <Text>GoBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2c6d44ff-afd8-478f-bc5f-7106b333a2ad">
      <Text>Jaca, your arrhythmia is showing on the main screen. The audience is starting to ping the "S.O.S." icons. They think you’re actually dying for a wing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5ff4ac3e-9fe0-4b32-b361-7465d6730416">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ea4639a4-c89c-45b9-9d21-a992c5011fad">
      <Text>Aren't we all? Every meal is a trade, Marrow Designer. I’m just... making the exchange... visible.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="090b20eb-fe32-4044-83c4-95aa3ce66ceb">
      <Text>Gobi reaches for the manual override lever.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="cc056b00-38b2-4d5c-b2b8-f1cf719df9a4">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1c0c80d4-0d94-4456-80fb-69acd91a35f1">
      <Text>Not like this. I’m not letting you become the "Blood" in the "No-Kill" narrative. I’m slaving the thermal regulation to the arena’s cooling system. I’m going to vent the excess heat into the rafters.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e56d3715-8191-463b-98c5-5864d5d454f6">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f59de6c6-8d02-4790-872e-a0e553fad307">
      <Text>You’ll set off the fire suppression! The foam will kill the vat!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9d4ad431-e59a-48ac-acd3-d5f62d3a21b6">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ba30af5d-b7a5-48eb-b1c9-ec491239157b">
      <Text>Then we better hope the judges like their wings "Extra Crispy."</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="293face5-b623-4cd7-981c-95d501349fb8">
      <Text>Gobi pulls the lever. A massive hiss of steam erupts from the base of the bioreactor. The golden light in the vat flares into a brilliant, blinding white.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b5f587a3-35bc-4a40-ace3-320f4dc7ccbd">
      <Text>ANNOUNCER (V.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="43b7055f-2a9a-46ea-acbf-17bbf5862b9c">
      <Text>Whoa! A steam-veil! The contestants are pushing the limits of the precipitation kitchen! Ten minutes to harvest!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7c8e07fe-ddd3-4abd-bd61-181f4c07caa5">
      <Text>The timer hits 09:59. The steam begins to dissipate, revealing JACA and GOBI as two soot-streaked shadows. The Cloud Protein inside the vat has undergone a transformation; it is no longer shimmering—it is seared. A deep, savory brown, with the iridescent Ruby rib glowing like an ember at its core.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2360712a-30ee-4db6-82df-6c2678bf7e15">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="df6796ad-a6ec-4b6d-aa62-7297db5324e0">
      <Text>(Coughing, eyes watering from the ozone)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7d108b31-8c6e-4cfe-87d2-5b970658ede7">
      <Text>Did it... did it hold?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b0865313-44d1-4aa5-a859-b788504a20a7">
      <Text>Gobi checks the vibrating tablet.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1c6cd627-2594-4418-b47a-3130364c36c9">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1b87eecd-b5a4-4510-b818-ddf8c545554e">
      <Text>Density: 1.0. Moisture: 72%. It’s... it’s a perfect recreation. August 2023. The month we stopped being predators. The CEO just cut the remote override. The metrics were too high. They’re pretending the "Steam-Veil" was an intentional marketing gimmick.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c1aacc46-0d80-4c25-a285-4f88275cef1a">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="887460c1-ff37-46fa-86d5-96726a254c76">
      <Text>Of course they are. They’re sell the "Pulse" as a premium seasoning.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e3eb565c-3f3f-4bd1-ad6c-101cac2d9561">
      <Text>ANNOUNCER (V.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c50cc55d-3c43-4c48-a5bb-d8c6b0c02464">
      <Text>Five minutes to harvest! The chicken wing is complete! The judges are approaching the tasting podium! Citizens, prepare your palates for the first bone in a generation!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e5331900-6fd5-4802-b232-a4597f437d92">
      <Text>Gobi picks up a sterile carving blade and offers it to Jaca.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d88bfbce-0ab2-481b-b736-5b669493583b">
      <Text>GoBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b039cf79-011d-4c98-acbd-7774da457e5e">
      <Text>You should do it. You’re the one who remembers how to follow a spine.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="855230e6-6339-4644-8d60-4188f3ff627e">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9fa1fce1-c48a-4cf5-9b7a-63c0f523f28e">
      <Text>No. You’re the one who’s gonna have to live in this world. You do the cut. I’ll just... hold the plate.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6e2ff5cd-fc1b-49f6-b9dd-365389b17f51">
      <Text>Gobi takes a deep breath and steps at the vat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6cd8233a-21de-456e-84ca-dd12bca79e8e">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="417a5f48-940e-4976-82d3-e8a4d19a206d">
      <Text>Thirty seconds to release. Jaca... if they hate it? If they say the bone is "primitive"?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6123363f-4a96-42fd-9b29-e0a2e001b204">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="916535d6-8a92-4f07-99a8-5ffbb2efa6aa">
      <Text>Then at least they’ll know they’re still alive enough to be offended.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="dfe66e04-1877-4ab1-b6be-e419fbce987d">
      <Text>The timer hits 00:00. A orchestral chime. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Hissssssss</Text>
      <Text>. The Chicken Wing settles onto the obsidian pedestal. It is solid, smoking, and undeniably heavy. Gobi makes the first cut as silhouettes of judges descend into a tight circle.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="dc6872a6-5ff3-4d09-8015-5315861b6a65">
      <Text>ANNOUNCER (V.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="382fa3c7-d76f-4e06-ba9b-023688ae81a7">
      <Text>Harvest complete! Fifty million calorie-credits on the line! Judges, commence the sensory audit.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0cd57b40-4096-4054-afb0-b10ff872a659">
      <Text>Jaca and Gobi stand back as silhouettes descend. They analyze. They strip the Cloud from the bone. On the Jumbotron, Jaca’s heart rate is still visible, as a jagged line.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="69508416-3f5f-4a26-91f4-f71a02ee4c63">
      <Text>GoBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5bc406a0-ac47-464c-bdb4-182a79df0b58">
      <Text>Look at Judge 2. The Serotonin levels are flat. They’re flagging the bone as Foreign Object Contamination" We’re losing the point-spread, Jaca.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="520da5f2-cafa-410b-a81a-08e8db62efb0">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2dfd6bf7-4384-44e0-b79e-0a2e99f799b3">
      <Text>They don’t know how to chew it. They’re looking for the Cloud and they found... resistance.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d2707b10-246b-464f-9946-0c17c8af9037">
      <Text>On the screen, "PENALTY" flashes: "TEXTURE AGGRESSION: -15 POINTS.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6f3f6b12-c0cc-4317-add3-feb83122e23b">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f5afcb37-df6d-421b-9fba-fcbb1295390f">
      <Text>We’re in the red. Jaca, if we drop three more points, the CEO initiates the sunset clause. We’re purged before the commercials hit.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="eb4fc27a-b961-4399-a377-931d1ee41ce7">
      <Text>ANNOUNCER (V.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c578c877-3322-4f19-a08b-0e329193f250">
      <Text>Is this meat? Or is this art? You decide!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0ff59521-b37c-4dff-9841-e707c694bb32">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f99b6e8b-e8fd-48c3-9701-5fac077db39c">
      <Text>Switch the feed. Now.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="00029945-fbc2-48b5-b03a-5ebb83346219">
      <Text>GoBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6e53616d-b50d-4b91-b534-5ba469183d25">
      <Text>Jaca, if I show them the </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">EKG</Text>
      <Text> raw-data—</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f9cbb2d7-2be6-4aac-9774-181e81cd8144">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ca03ce46-0638-4365-bdae-6c5d84e6778a">
      <Text>Show them the beat! If they won't vote for the meat, make them vote for our heart.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f559f6ae-f474-4fa7-8a19-2678058386f8">
      <Text>Gobi swipes a desperate command. The Jumbotron snaps from the seared wing to a close-up of Jaca’s pale, sweat-streaked face and the frantic, syncopated rhythm of the two hearts. The holographic crowd in the rafters goes silent. The Sympathy Meter begins to crawl upward.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="40335f16-f530-45ea-8041-30782527c85f">
      <Text>ANNOUNCER (V.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3b73a599-5ac6-4692-aeb4-267df4c7e0ed">
      <Text>Wait... Look at the sacrifice! The marrow designers are giving their own biometrics to hold the foundation! The public vote is spiking!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="620e9396-dbb2-4a0e-b023-7ef0e42122bd">
      <Text>An agonizing silence. The judges consult. The tally board flickers. A flickering gold light appears next to their names.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6fe05cfe-5c21-4540-8dbf-affe45ceeee8">
      <Text>AnNOUNCER (V.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="cb094d0e-be04-4045-aacc-09ff1318679d">
      <Text>By a margin of 0.03 percent... Jaca and Gobi advance! It is the narrowest win in the history of the Final Harvest!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="dbe6d66b-1008-4b96-8e36-a3d9bba637ef">
      <Text>The arena erupts, but the sound is hollow. Gobi collapses into a chair. Jaca remains tethered to the vat, staring at the chicken wing. It looks like the last thing to survive a nuclear war.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b51416ad-0772-49b6-93bf-caf583e14718">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ed51ba0d-5a49-496b-9548-8d3327afc906">
      <Text>We didn't win, Gobi. We just bought six weeks of life.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d815ab90-a6c0-421c-b9b5-bb79d2727d8b">
      <Text>The 2063 Golden Jubilee of the 2013 London Burger countdown shows up on the Jumbotron.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e0b36bd7-2031-43c8-a602-533cffb7da27">
      <Text>The tablet receives a ping.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="39a72246-ea37-4e7c-89ad-a23819e61dcb">
      <Text>GoBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6d1f080f-88ec-4af0-97ed-8cf7cc9317ec">
      <Text>The CEO just sent a ping. “Congratulations on the performance. Don't let the Burger kill you. It’s bad for the brand.”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e15ec494-0eab-4d57-a4f9-619cc0fee5c4">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2a16d52f-d54c-44a7-b236-a9573c98dc27">
      <Text>Forty-five days. Next time, the bone won't be enough. We’re gonna need a miracle.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1c0968a1-b654-4ef2-b9d5-cf9114ac4ccd">
      <Text>Black out.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Info" id="af681496-bc4f-416e-bc09-1ed582588156">
      <Text>Scene 2</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="1f62d9b0-9b12-444c-8f3a-86461cdc5a79">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 5/8" Page="16" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="GOBI">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="JACA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>The kitchen Arena</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3df605a5-dd71-468c-9525-ee5ab7413ed2">
      <Text>June 21, 2063, evening.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6208745b-d176-4632-9f87-ed4eff3a5a43">
      <Text>The main arena lights are off. Only a few service lights illuminate Jaca and Gobi, who look exhausted. The Jumbotron above flickers silently with corporate logos. Gobi is polishing a set of holographic knives again. Jaca wipes down a stainless steel counter.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1ca7b42a-7762-41d3-acf6-2c6294872b19">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="86315c33-a028-4e2e-b6ba-4ff20d30e2fd">
      <Text>Consume mercy... Gobi?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="49107fdc-5199-467e-8b40-f1eb4ec21199">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="37b0920f-3cb4-4ff7-a589-3cf4eed3ff0d">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Mhmm</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0ba44bb9-9ac8-43c5-87c5-72049e968c64">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a347c0ea-826e-4a0e-9d9b-6f7f4f95217b">
      <Text>Do you actually believe that?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="eee1c51e-2d95-4c64-b6bf-fd7111b05536">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="82d66923-c71c-400d-a18a-10329bf08930">
      <Text>Believe what?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="86c46589-e7e9-441c-9a84-b501a9064b14">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ec172593-7c68-4990-80bf-9a2f741398de">
      <Text>That we consume... </Text>
      <Text Style="Italic">mercy</Text>
      <Text>. That this... this whole operation is about mercy.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="571fb90d-3ebe-414b-b796-85718e1322fd">
      <Text>Gobi holds a knife up to the light, inspecting it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="62c2a8d7-c3a0-4476-83e2-1f41ee28575e">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5d8ba2c0-0117-49d5-adc2-92dbfea3c3cf">
      <Text>It started that way. Forty years ago. The first lab-grown wing was a promise. A promise we kept.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a4f3b82d-3fa2-4212-a562-17ae423d0c66">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0dba8e06-9573-4c4f-9d1e-50a9d06e39b6">
      <Text>And now?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="29902218-df75-4036-b286-81e7a6928eb6">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="80200823-ba2c-4332-8242-a5b6c2af09b1">
      <Text>Now it’s a brand. Look at that ads. “Boneless.” “Mercy with Every Bite.” They want the feeling, Jaca, but they don't want the memory of its risks.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f03cffb0-ef2f-4e69-b3ea-40af979edd97">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="45fa6397-c9b5-4eaa-ada9-bade3ba604ea">
      <Text>The risks were pretty high, Gobi. My father's oxygen-debt... the air back then... it was a relief when the pastures became forests again.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ddf03a37-25ae-4759-9ca4-a0bb816bd792">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="40063b74-a806-4b59-856b-9b028ea62b6c">
      <Text>A relief is not a virtue. It's an absence. We don't eat meat. We consume an absence of guilt. There's a difference.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7ec3d85c-8257-4078-8ddd-2736c4d62045">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="86bb2c08-bf6a-4a15-9902-cb0ff969cc88">
      <Text>Does it matter, as long as it feeds everyone?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="99f2abed-be8f-46e8-b31f-40fd94ff47a3">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b1fbe38e-d55b-48ea-938d-98bc20a453bd">
      <Text>Yes.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8cd2ccea-d531-4b68-810a-4abb1033244e">
      <Text>Gobi places the knives in their case. The Jumbotron changes to a close-up of a smiling CEO.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="97063759-0261-48ab-b887-1ef29449b63b">
      <Text>GOBI (CONT'D</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b4bd0479-38b7-4439-b352-2bce63a59cb2">
      <Text>Because if you don't know what you've lost, you can't value what you have.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8d2f67f4-b97f-4ada-81e6-f2fdbb58f1b0">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="fad1675f-bd91-49aa-ba3c-a2f89d03b4b1">
      <Text>Maybe valuing it means leaving the pain behind.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="611b9d86-a36c-4a5f-915f-b7c16aeacf2a">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="fd7b86f3-4820-481d-87db-a7ec18fb26c2">
      <Text>Pain is the only thing that makes it real.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9305f982-e4cd-4be9-aebc-a8ab8e773bbe">
      <Text>Jaca stops wiping the counter and slaps Gobi with a towel.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d70c0136-a63e-4e0f-9934-f1c0b18e6b57">
      <Text>Jaca</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6718305e-f7cc-4731-854b-b6ef20b8770e">
      <Text>Too real.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="51125c31-b90e-4619-ab45-0f2a38a6d7fc">
      <Text>Black out.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Info" id="af681496-bc4f-416e-bc09-1ed582588156">
      <Text>Scene 3</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="1f62d9b0-9b12-444c-8f3a-86461cdc5a79">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 3/8" Page="18" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="GOBI">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="JACA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>The kitchen Arena</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="cdd6a1ad-00f1-47fb-904d-131baf61fd62">
      <Text>June 22, 2063, early morning.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7f518fe4-55a0-4c1b-aa16-ec1a553ec911">
      <Text>The arena is dark and silent, save for the hum of the Bioreactor </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">XY</Text>
      <Text>. Jaca is slumped against the console, asleep. Gobi is sitting on the floor, back against the console, a small, worn photograph in their hand.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="cf1926d1-e468-47f6-bc72-d34e0d656ebd">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b13ea646-cea4-4510-b59b-0863bcee932c">
      <Text>You know, I once saw a cow.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fb36abdc-b25f-40d9-b3a9-351343f9a883">
      <Text>Jaca stirs, not fully awake.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="dc2947d7-1b5f-47f8-8310-94708eac0d75">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0934361a-c9b5-4f82-b05f-8282f2175047">
      <Text>A... a real one?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1ee58741-d3b9-4955-aaa7-3e4cdec0edb4">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ae8037fe-265a-498a-8f9a-0b0a90261f07">
      <Text>Before the Great Peace. They were in a field, just... chewing grass. They had a heartbeat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="caa0b3a0-a9b6-4442-bee4-9c4a85e71f36">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="00e7592d-5c73-4143-b709-cf10cf5c07d5">
      <Text>And?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6b060282-9479-455a-901a-9e739554587e">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="76cfa813-cfbc-4732-b554-87a5106d0b94">
      <Text>I had a burger that night. A real one. It was... heavy. And when I ate it, I just kept thinking about that thud in the field. I couldn't stop thinking about it. The smell of the grill, the juice... it all just felt like a lie. A beautiful, delicious lie that was built on a terror.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c535128d-f3df-4764-b348-0e3ecd909e2a">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d49ca78d-d268-4924-96d1-eb4641aa395e">
      <Text>So you built this world to forget that feeling.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="217ce6ff-4e8e-4c29-8773-dd2e52896ce9">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8e48c433-980d-4f0a-ad27-99d1ce087e27">
      <Text>I built this world so no one else had to feel it. But I didn't realize... we'd forget the animal entirely. The bone is my penance, Jaca. It's the memory I have to chew on.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="618608f9-7664-41b6-a911-a9d3cc2fe697">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="957e282b-6376-4a74-a60d-706087b4d7c5">
      <Text>Your dad jokes... My father has an oxygen debt. Three months overdue. He can't afford the clear air in the Highland Zones. He breathes... a discount atmosphere. This license buys him life, </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">gobi</Text>
      <Text>. It buys him the right to breathe without a corporate tether attached to his-</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f3ecc470-1b44-4972-afcf-87faf4752afa">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9001ce8c-039f-44f0-a010-544c464a534c">
      <Text>...leash? I know that. I'm just trying to make sure the life we buy... the life he breathes... is worth it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="521bb4ee-8384-431e-8029-e8316639d442">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b59d8d9f-2059-405a-b559-4f7c079fdc88">
      <Text>He just needs the harvest to stay upright long enough to get us into the Golden Jubilee.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="64d6bffa-4ddc-4416-ad9c-b33979e47652">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d2c153e0-f691-4fc9-8466-ae28ef52941c">
      <Text>Then let's make sure it's a harvest with a spine.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="93cfd37d-a36e-4ef9-b6c8-cfd7045fd828">
      <Text>Gobi puts the photo away and stands up, stretching. Jaca rubs their eyes, looking at the sleeping vat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="80980439-f006-4159-b455-bb755c7310e9">
      <Text>Black out.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Info" id="af681496-bc4f-416e-bc09-1ed582588156">
      <Text>Scene 3</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="b6576536-13c4-4385-b91f-112b143862f4">
      <SceneProperties Length="2" Page="20" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="CEO">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="GOBI">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="JACA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Boardroom</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b32c5c82-2c7a-4af9-9ad4-c37f67cd6cdd">
      <Text>A sterile, minimalist boardroom. A long, white table. Jaca and Gobi are seated on one side. Gobi looks exhausted. Jaca is wired and excited. A large, silent Jumbotron flickers with generic corporate logos. An intercom system sits on the table.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2e63fecf-5820-447b-95b0-fc213d2b4acb">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2c791625-7d12-4f2f-8c2d-4cc2c7dcc4c7">
      <Text>The CEO wanted a meeting! A meeting in the actual boardroom! This is huge, Gobi!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="515ac010-6786-406c-942a-4b3e1386ec29">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="50193b34-044b-4089-a020-5dd147d9f782">
      <Text>It’s a butcher’s shop...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9acd5a9d-71de-43a3-8c65-4b335992c9d6">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="791e8b36-ef3d-4ba0-888b-cd0efd3570f8">
      <Text>What? </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Anywho</Text>
      <Text>, it means we're official. We're part of the legacy.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="61497898-0a6a-486b-8d07-08867d20afde">
      <Text>A speaker crackles to life.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="05000f8c-f53a-47f7-81ce-d52d45412da1">
      <Text>CEO (V.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f649bbd4-03fc-4a31-8293-5501a1a6790d">
      <Text>Jaca, Gobi. Congratulations. The metrics are phenomenal. A record six billion viewers. Your effect is called a “culinary leap forward” by the press. Pure theatre.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b7b0e435-3c04-481d-8b03-efdb376e9e68">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="-0.10" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.00" RightIndent="5.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Parenthetical" id="0f159758-1dbe-441f-8f3e-057ad24b27b4">
      <Text>(Muttering)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="93d3a2ab-ff62-4666-b06d-8e75b141e91b">
      <Text>It was a structural stress test, not theater. We almost blew the vat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ac8565e0-2754-4ab5-8e42-b3699f073fcb">
      <Text>CEO (V.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="88a1d6bb-0a19-4c35-88b4-de46e239207c">
      <Text>An acceptable risk. You presented the public with something they didn't know they wanted: a spectacle. You made the process visible. Brilliant marketing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="eb2b5fb7-7dd5-46da-99b5-b6f8863359ed">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8484fdb8-52f6-45bf-80f1-013ebe5812dc">
      <Text>The public vote is spiking because they saw the sacrifice, the biometrics. They saw us give the Cloud Protein a heartbeat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="aefa974e-097a-4f76-ab6d-0f1d7feb1dba">
      <Text>CEO (V.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ba658951-46f2-4132-b2a0-949c89104bc1">
      <Text>The public saw passionate designers testing our tech for the brand. That's the story, Jaca. No "heartbeat". We don't need the public to assume you're essential to the product. The system is seamless.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a536b148-7ab0-424d-ba82-c9d73d08cda3">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="354d616f-5519-43b9-afe8-f82fe397623f">
      <Text>A seamless system is a lie.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="aefa974e-097a-4f76-ab6d-0f1d7feb1dba">
      <Text>CEO (V.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f304bb18-8d50-4199-a57a-2a086111275b">
      <Text>A lie provides security. A lie ensures the Great Peace. We don't need the memory of the struggle, Gobi. We need the absence of guilt. That's the brand: “Boneless.”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="49fe17ed-01e9-4fe3-878c-8de6506403ae">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c6ae581d-f25c-4a07-9792-7623b4a741c8">
      <Text>Mercy is a heavy word with no backbone. You want the feeling of peace, but you don't want the memory of the risk.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="aefa974e-097a-4f76-ab6d-0f1d7feb1dba">
      <Text>CEO (V.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="014d1901-e93d-47c5-b80d-2884457f9b54">
      <Text>The risk is a liability, Doctor. Your antiquated methods, this obsession with the past... it's a danger to the entire operation. We promoted you to the Orbital Garden to get you out of the main facility. Consider this a final warning: ensure the harvest in the Garden is silent. Clean. Pure-Fluid.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3abf5158-44b9-4581-86cd-279bce67b244">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8c5d965f-6eaf-4e90-89c4-65b6ce4490ab">
      <Text>But the public liked the pulse... The beat...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="aefa974e-097a-4f76-ab6d-0f1d7feb1dba">
      <Text>CEO (V.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2be022ea-8b17-4249-9f11-b827a7e556cc">
      <Text>The public likes a good story, Jaca. We write the script. Don't mess it up with sentimentality. Don’t dwell on past beefs.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="64e81e82-921f-4d78-b931-71f78a2c4453">
      <Text>The Jumbotron suddenly changes from the corporate logo to a text: “OXYGEN AUDIT APPROVED. FINANCIAL DEBT CLEARED.”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="aefa974e-097a-4f76-ab6d-0f1d7feb1dba">
      <Text>CEO (V.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="346d882f-20c3-437a-8e53-24160b71084b">
      <Text>Now, if you'll excuse me, the Wild Ministers are expecting a briefing on Cloud Protein Optimization. Jaca, your father's oxygen audit was approved this morning. Congratulations.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8c07deb8-b647-43e1-ae3d-a12ab3198919">
      <Text>The speaker cuts out abruptly. Gobi and Jaca sit in silence for a beat. Jaca stares at the screen.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="011ac623-ca28-4404-a574-816c0b9fa840">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="81c36827-83d9-4e5c-8b5c-9f89eaf73f90">
      <Text>They're terrified the world will find out that the meat still needs a person.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ea6a95f9-6ef6-462a-b57e-d757d3a1c048">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="64227234-f34b-4b60-8d76-dd1572a14667">
      <Text>Then we'll make them hear the beat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f60b4748-1969-4d52-a32b-0af78baf72e5">
      <Text>Black out.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Info" id="af681496-bc4f-416e-bc09-1ed582588156">
      <Text>Scene 4</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="88997424-8c1e-4f18-a55c-6e40ec342ea3">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 4/8" Page="22" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PARENT">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="YOUNG GOBI">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>APARTMENT</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="497dc915-6bad-4e22-8e68-c6a4fb83c233">
      <Text>August 2033. Evening.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b61e63a6-7ee6-42aa-b456-0263b515ab1e">
      <Text>The apartment is small, but tidy. A TV flickers with a news report about global food security.A small table is set for one.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="148862d0-b467-4419-8fe6-ba8e1ee0c075">
      <Text>The only character on stage is YOUNG GOBI, who enters the apartment, looking exhausted and stressed. They drop their bag on a small counter, a small, worn photograph sticking out of a pocket.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="85503900-97fa-4849-9746-4275799d4262">
      <Text>Parent (V.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f2f1d4df-83f9-488a-b355-38748c0f17b1">
      <Text>Late again, Gobi. Thought you were bringing the main course. The miracle.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a5c17557-86e4-4ccf-845f-a09166014427">
      <Text>YOUNG GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0673d8fc-c0f0-4d32-904b-580b7175438b">
      <Text>Yeah. Chicken wing traffic.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="53090cc1-c4f9-4b10-8c4a-4ffde0e144ee">
      <Text>Parent (V.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f6f2643e-23a9-486c-a12b-744d728a2281">
      <Text>It's a miracle all the same. The Wing. Imagine, honey, clean air for the grandkids. No more filters!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d6cc7e53-553c-451b-b9f7-1a13177ca738">
      <Text>GOBI crosses to the small counter, avoiding the table.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="92946ff3-dac1-45aa-b473-50bcf94d34c2">
      <Text>Parent (V.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="af12e2b2-0e46-486f-8411-f0e294529fd6">
      <Text>Says here they’re expecting a seventy percent drop in methane emissions in ten years! And water usage! Your work, Gobi. Your work is saving the planet.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7ac431f1-d3c7-4f23-81cd-b712119f2f03">
      <Text>YOUNG GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b4e8f5cc-45a8-47f8-a57b-b3f040b122ba">
      <Text>Just a lot of numbers.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6359f513-2216-42f3-afb3-ac7097dca381">
      <Text>Parent (V.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="bcff426f-145a-484b-bcda-d5cf41fa97d8">
      <Text>It's more than numbers. It's security. For us. For your future. No more stress about the price of meat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="205d6933-c7e7-4ebb-9674-8db804d83133">
      <Text>Gobi digs a hand into their pocket, fingers touching the edge of a photograph.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f29478e7-4278-4b21-8156-04f1bd0d1344">
      <Text>YOUNG GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b19ef185-8964-49a4-be39-7e2a05c2fa84">
      <Text>I saw a cow today. A real one. Just like this picture.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6f5e721d-ef7c-4ecb-9d3c-1b9d24148298">
      <Text>Parent (V.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4842ceed-95e4-4aef-990b-9ed033b5a1c9">
      <Text>A cow? What on earth for? That's the old world, son. The mess. The terror. We're moving past that. They’re roaming where we don’t need to.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="55fc3b59-df18-4d2c-9145-c7dd3b58aaca">
      <Text>Parent (V.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="748d574f-bd75-4f1b-85fc-5d4e7198a659">
      <Text>Is everything alright at the lab? Your mentor isn't pushing you too hard, are they?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d85ba760-9fad-4b64-9dff-3bfd4f16c841">
      <Text>YOUNG GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="aab0fbde-176f-45c6-9584-483c1180cbf5">
      <Text>No. Everything’s great. The cells are... compliant.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a506a35e-524d-4f5e-ab80-cd9e0ea12aaf">
      <Text>Gobi picks up a fork from the counter and mimes poking at a plate, with a look of unease.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="cd5f44d7-a081-4c50-a98b-5cb42cd3d4d8">
      <Text>Parent (V.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="10a083f6-f7e3-4315-83bb-e41f79f8084e">
      <Text>Good. Because this license is our ticket, Gobi. This is it. The big break. Don't mess it up with sentimentality. Don’t dwell on past beefs.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2edf2e4a-61a1-4b86-a3ea-84e91a8cd71f">
      <Text>Gobi looks from the plate to the photo in their pocket.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="75433393-496f-4b6e-af1a-304abcde0c87">
      <Text>Black out.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="End of Act" id="08536e41-1a30-4a93-a2de-c23282464060">
      <Text Style="Underline+AllCaps">End of Act I</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="New Act" id="5c27492e-c03e-4a50-8c99-ad9c114c1b65">
      <Text Style="Underline+AllCaps">Act </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Style="Underline+AllCaps">II</Text>
      <Text Style="Underline+AllCaps">: The Liminal Marrow</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Info" id="af681496-bc4f-416e-bc09-1ed582588156">
      <Text>Scene 1</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="1f62d9b0-9b12-444c-8f3a-86461cdc5a79">
      <SceneProperties Length="4 6/8" Page="24" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="GOBI">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="JACA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Observation Deck / Ship</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="02f3faff-5283-4403-accd-a5e410e5fe51">
      <Text>July 2063. Weeks after the Wing Preliminary</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1a43b64d-c74f-4289-98d7-e933308c9c63">
      <Text>A high-speed mag-lev observation deck. Outside the panoramic windows, the Earth is vibrant—lush green corridors of re-</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">wilded</Text>
      <Text> forests stretching where pastures once stood. The sky is a clear, crystalline blue. The high-tech thrum of Act I has been replaced by the near-silent whisper of magnetic rails.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d33a1f1b-3bbf-414a-8f89-64468ebd6424">
      <Text>A split stage with two spotlights. Jaca stands, arranging a digital herbarium of culinary plants on a tablet. Gobi sits, looking out the window. A glowing umbilical wire leads from Gobi’s sleeve into a portable battery pack nestled in a duffel bag.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="81e9aa44-3481-4976-a224-600c82df54bf">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="-0.10" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.00" RightIndent="5.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Parenthetical" id="12ba42c1-1bc4-47b6-b830-d39afad1e9b0">
      <Text>(to the audience)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d494e34c-3638-42da-8b59-4ce7c8c54cb1">
      <Text>We didn’t just save the air... we saved the silence. Look at the horizon. Those forests used to be dust and bone. We traded the slaughterhouse for the foundry, and the Earth breathed back. But a world without hunger is a world that forgets. We’ve grown the "Cloud," but we’ve lost the weight of the story. I’m not just a Marrow Designer; I’m a librarian of the tongue. I’m trying to make sure that when we eat, we still remember the ground.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="448bcdb9-a4e9-4d67-b6dd-3851d8187288">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="-0.10" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.00" RightIndent="5.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Parenthetical" id="300b3779-096c-4c22-8d3c-554b3849d53b">
      <Text>(to the audience)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f1d9cbdc-227d-4bd8-b7be-072403d34c92">
      <Text>They call it the Great Peace. A world where no creature has to die for a feast. It’s a miracle I spent thirty years building. But a miracle without friction is just a dream. Jaca thinks we’re going to the Orbital Garden to win a prize. We’re going there to prove that Kind Meat can have a soul. The 2013 London Burger ain’t a product. It is however a handshake between our technology and our ancestors. Look at me be a conductor today.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d1e2c439-d9cf-4205-8c86-c5bc3704371c">
      <Text>The two spotlights merge as Jaca joins Gobi at the window.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="eecf6621-ec5b-4d50-b216-328771ea0ab2">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="290b66ed-d412-4831-9e77-56ba6b065ac5">
      <Text>The CEO didn’t evict us, Gobi. They promoted us. The 2023 Wing was a hit. They want the Golden Burger to be the centerpiece of the New Era. They want the world to see that the Cloud has a backbone.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a919627e-cb56-42d1-a019-d8d5f7fb49ee">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="74a4e71c-4998-4a2f-a556-64bc6f8ab760">
      <Text>They want the backbone, Jaca, but they’re still terrified of the bone. They want the beauty of the forest without the memory of the struggle.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7b98db3a-0a49-413c-84ca-ce43b20f50e9">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="16e6213a-2fc8-4fc7-9258-de84357f8d1f">
      <Text>They want stability. My father needs stability. His oxygen-audit was approved this morning because of our metrics. For the first time in his life, he isn't breathing on a debt-schedule. If we win the Bio-License at the Jubilee, I can buy him a permanent slot in the Highland Zones.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8c89f693-c6c7-4335-bf40-780e5cc12a53">
      <Text>Gobi touches their wrist patch.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f12fed5e-c1cf-40ce-bf16-eb65b45f9133">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1c64ff37-48e0-4263-92fe-cb1c5d449ebe">
      <Text>And you think a promotion to the stars comes without a leash? Look at this patch. I’m slaved to the cargo hold. The 2013 variant is shivering, Jaca. It’s realized it doesn't have a body to mimic. It’s thirsty.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="38bf597c-0a48-4753-b575-b4286a27522a">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a8de9da4-a9a0-4eef-9f0e-63c2c4775b9b">
      <Text>The ship is regulating the nutrient-flow. You don’t need to be the conductor today.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="23e298a1-7738-4375-a7bb-f8e12eb639d3">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8acc0139-f8a8-41ec-9fad-77c69b99329e">
      <Text>The AI doesn't know how to "conduct" a legacy. It knows how to replicate a result. There’s a difference.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="825334f0-538a-44d8-a0bf-b1298bd3deb2">
      <Text>Gobi coughs.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4e6b34cb-3e90-48c7-8a08-c3f031dc767a">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3f2dd9e3-6e88-4c1b-a851-145586ca09f7">
      <Text>The London Burger wasn't just protein; it was an apology. A three-hundred-thousand-dollar confession that we had broken the world. If we serve them a "Pure-Fluid" version that doesn't have the weight of that apology, we aren't scientists. We’re just caterers for a lie.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1abc758e-5843-4aec-89c6-0ef93e7dcd0d">
      <Text>Jaca reads their tablet.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="acfbc32b-9c06-4b44-a11a-b75e1805ea73">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1e2d3537-f708-43ef-9962-c8f61dfadfd3">
      <Text>The mag-lev is entering the launch-shroud. Sixty minutes until we dock at the Orbital Garden. The CEO just sent a final briefing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f5ad9b16-c17c-4b69-bdf5-b09a27af2261">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="df3d1673-6e00-449b-8d97-b6d357b4252f">
      <Text>Let me guess: "Keep it light. Keep it Meatless. Don't mention the heartbeats."</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b9833d07-3e45-4124-b083-03ca002cd731">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="361f23fa-d70b-41e3-af00-ff9852809e4d">
      <Text>"Ensure the harvest reflects the serenity of the New Era."</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5ac704b8-392a-4fec-aed0-fec4019374d3">
      <Text>A soft, harmonic chime. The floor begins to tilt upward as the mag-lev enters the launch-shroud. The lush green of Earth begins to shrink through the window, replaced by the brilliant, hopeful light of the void.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d92265b9-a1ae-4772-9fc2-773668036bd6">
      <Text>The G-force pushes them back into the seat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6bc0b411-23d8-4a63-9bda-8d0eb9b0af99">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7e2eb8d8-1971-4cff-8ab5-a4e7648f3dcc">
      <Text>They want serenity? Look out that window, Jaca. That's a billion-units view of peace we had to fight for. The serenity is in the memory of the struggle.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b46b5322-c1e2-4bb3-8ad8-fac7e74fe657">
      <Text>Jaca clutches at the tablet, watching the Earth shrink.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="28a8ec95-c0a2-432d-b56b-23bef80125bd">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="403d7261-a0c1-4c17-8e74-3940c731305d">
      <Text>Then why does it feel like a weight? I spent my life trying to make the world lighter, Gobi. I don't want the struggle. I want the security. I want my father to breathe clean air without a corporate tether attached to his lungs.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="723dba16-03e8-4435-b4d0-bbe5565d405b">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a6a7d9a5-a80f-44ee-8208-42f145726948">
      <Text>You can't have one without the other. You can't have a world without a heart attack without remembering the cost of a heartbeat. That's why we're taking the Jubilee to the stars.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e74cba00-afe0-42b8-9ca2-45bdb79c7c19">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f0c36ad7-07dd-4305-9e6b-aeb020af0685">
      <Text>To the Orbital Garden. They say the air up there... they say it smells like rain on a 20th-century summer day.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c5d73ae6-4474-4994-a338-04b961e1f379">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e8b5879a-a0df-4bf2-b37c-db920dee500e">
      <Text>They got that part right. They say they captured the essence of the Earth's first breath after the Last Smog. A brilliant piece of engineering.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3bf8e379-8246-49d2-ad5e-e4e9d221e8c3">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2212ccfc-0034-469d-9cb0-aae61ebf0319">
      <Text>We're almost at the dock. Sixty minutes until we transition to the station. Are you stable?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a083c3e5-3afa-4fda-8a44-a7d943467694">
      <Text>GoBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f6180f8b-cc38-4afe-b33c-7cc9a883f55d">
      <Text>I'm stable. I'm Gobi-spec.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ed9f60f9-0dcd-4d85-af56-4b0c9a79523b">
      <Text>Gobi reaches out, touching Jaca’s hand. The wrist-patch pulses a golden light that synchronizes with Jaca's pulse.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="dc95787a-1771-4c61-a04d-8ed25bd4e213">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="53ba4015-7727-49ec-8a41-fa93a67e3100">
      <Text>We're a dual-core, Jaca. We can hold the weight.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="84ff416e-c271-4f32-bd68-c74752d1e50a">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ddeb7931-1a25-4430-8d38-ddfbbaa9bd1b">
      <Text>Together?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d558975f-4474-4190-b1c4-90bafc96c48e">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2961c12d-cca2-4c8e-b566-544bdbb30471">
      <Text>Together. For the forest.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5fbbc3b0-30f3-4aed-9ff7-0beb72b4a2e9">
      <Text>A harmonic chime. The G-force pushes them back into their seats as the mag-lev accelerates into the docking shroud. The lush green of Earth is completely gone, replaced by the brilliant, hopeful light of the sun and the vast black of the void.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fdfec47f-63b7-4164-b2a2-d57a8c810861">
      <Text>The harmonic chime deepens into a resonant, rhythmic thrum. Through the panoramic windows, the stars are no longer distant pinpricks; they are unblinking eyes watching the shuttle dock.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8dfb4eee-474c-45ea-a915-cd7fff446cc9">
      <Text>Jaca unstraps their safety harness as the G-force subsides.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1e604a86-00e7-46e9-9374-ddac87bcccad">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="cd1f4cd4-54a8-4c3c-b56d-b2fcdc0004bc">
      <Text>We’re at zero-G. Transition in five minutes.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="73af61ed-2669-4e27-b3ce-32c4087a1bbd">
      <Text>Gobi checks the wrist patch, which now glows.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b695ebc1-ccae-47aa-9198-31c2e8ffdea1">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="cb9b43e0-f9f8-4057-9399-e1b1b1dcbfdb">
      <Text>The 2013-spec has stilled. It likes the </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Meatlessness</Text>
      <Text>, Jaca. It’s finally found its form. It’s not a cloud anymore; it’s a monument.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9d470dbe-e438-4272-80ef-d87a70fc4090">
      <Text>Jaca looks out at the approaching station with its rotating wheel of silver and green.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3b331a50-5060-44f8-ae09-5bea4e48aa73">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ba3e97a3-58ee-4624-8742-c96b2d8ed0ef">
      <Text>The Orbital Garden. It looks exactly like the archival renders. I spent six months coding the sunlight-diffusion for this sector. I never thought I’d actually breathe the air.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="513a8ba5-5824-469e-bab7-29b48465c5ef">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="36e817b4-0e26-4259-9c5f-8a598a580b94">
      <Text>Don’t just breathe it. Feel it. We’re about to serve a heartbeat to a station that was built to forget they exist.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="21cb0266-830d-44b9-9dd0-76a078bff091">
      <Text>Jaca picks up their tablet, and takes a deep breath.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2bdc328c-c96f-44be-9ba9-2a7157850a88">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="256d569e-0d72-431e-87b9-b23ffb50be9f">
      <Text>The CEO’s proxy is waiting at the airlock. Remember: we are the face of the New Era. Professional. Visionary.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="849ffbd7-491f-4eac-a04e-600bacc85463">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="83bb6b8a-f48a-4422-9d3e-e717a2114803">
      <Text>And hungry. Don't forget that part. If they aren't hungry for the truth, they'll never swallow the meal.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5c4c4cfb-b8d3-49c0-ad7f-aafde755e056">
      <Text>A hiss as the shuttle docks. The mag-lev doors slide open, revealing a lush corridor where the scent is of a summer rain. Jaca and Gobi step out together, their silhouettes framed by the blue light of the Earth below.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="eafdcd42-ba65-48ac-8238-06ae856ac386">
      <Text>Black out.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Info" id="af681496-bc4f-416e-bc09-1ed582588156">
      <Text>Scene 2</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="1f62d9b0-9b12-444c-8f3a-86461cdc5a79">
      <SceneProperties Length="8 3/8" Page="28" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ANNOUNCER">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="GOBI">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="JACA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>The Orbital Garden</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="82e3b21d-0907-437a-b2d4-96fd0dfa1221">
      <Text>July 2063.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1ef5b9e1-3b3a-4616-afaf-bc85b23b3bc3">
      <Text>It is a high-tech conservatory. Translucent walls reveal the stars, and the floor is bioluminescent moss. In the center, a sleek Bioreactor </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">XY</Text>
      <Text> sits like a sculpture. Jaca meticulously prunes lab-grown tomatoes, while Gobi, tethered to the vat by a wire, sits peacefully but appears thin.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f94bb857-9323-43a6-81ad-97de29cae6d4">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="-0.10" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.00" RightIndent="5.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Parenthetical" id="4ba7a009-bb5d-4ad8-b158-35560b707fce">
      <Text>(to the audience)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="49887266-f1ac-433c-a08f-695001635480">
      <Text>Day fifteen. The Great Peace follows us even here. In the foundry on Earth, the silence was heavy, like a warning. Here, it’s a blanket. The CEO calls this the "Incubation of Peace." They want the Golden Burger to absorb the literal atmosphere of the Garden. They think if the meat breathes the scent of rain, it will forget it ever needed a bone. But Gobi... Gobi isn't forgetting.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="92e272dc-90e6-4b6a-b030-31b1bc7d989f">
      <Text>(to Gobi)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="202b5803-03eb-47e6-8bea-74087b39abd0">
      <Text>Gobi? You okay?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f05b4800-6f92-4bdc-a1d0-f14ad6df957f">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="-0.10" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.00" RightIndent="5.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Parenthetical" id="a8a3514d-b858-43d4-895e-163ae3f19d47">
      <Text>(With eyes closed)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="89701a24-6905-49cc-b062-c149b179e882">
      <Text>It’s not a shiver today, Jaca. It’s a purr.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b6ab094c-632b-45cc-a0d5-dac8982d6c89">
      <Text>Gobi extends their hand to a nearby bioluminescent shrub. They carefully part the leaves to reveal a lab-created </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">hummingbird</Text>
      <Text>, hovering.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="cbab8523-6140-4e22-a362-273a9d2ddba0">
      <Text>Gobi</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ae65ed53-2b03-4cbc-8317-743b795f958a">
      <Text>They’re even engineered the animals here...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a9496ce9-511b-4902-b375-d0e22366087c">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="799a348a-ab5e-4775-a95a-29779310b076">
      <Text>Your biometric levels are dipping into the blue. You need to un-tether for an hour. Eat something real.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6d23bf6d-7bb4-44b3-ada6-c6ba4ecd2295">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3d47b346-dd7f-40a7-8b93-ed69a56fa287">
      <Text>If I un-tether, the purr stops.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5d7dc655-1a7a-4370-9832-b337bdb2c083">
      <Text>Jaca kneels beside Gobi, reaching for the sensor patch.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7f60d617-002f-4890-9713-d07c2de70964">
      <Text>GobI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="075a7fde-69de-4e72-8614-342a98946fa0">
      <Text>No... Leave it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b6cba0c9-71df-4147-81fa-57fe1e44fe88">
      <Text>Jaca</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f3a8f938-3ea5-4fec-90c9-80f7d9659c3f">
      <Text>It’s a burn, Gobi. A literal burn in your arm.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="641906d7-86a1-415e-bacf-dca6082e392f">
      <Text>Jaca gestures to a small, sleek refrigerator unit in the wall.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ab13d9d5-fa4b-44f5-b1cc-223aee20be25">
      <Text>JACA (CONT'D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7cec89c8-1543-41a2-be68-844daac1181c">
      <Text>Look. I saved some real Earth-grown protein from the flight. It’s not much, just a small piece of processed pork. But it has protein, nutrients we need.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0e3a085f-40bc-41c4-958f-08fadaeeca76">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a710ab55-1fbb-4fcf-b9f0-ed85e808d4dc">
      <Text>Pork? Where's the bone?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ae67e0f7-f33c-45e1-a3a9-b47376719868">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7a766c4d-925a-4fc7-ab00-6962b078e8d8">
      <Text>There is no bone! It's just meat, Gobi. Fuel. Energy. You look terrible. You're giving the meat a heartbeat, but you're forgetting your own.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f7336f4e-663e-4f22-b295-94f29ea01a41">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8b1d84aa-faef-4322-be8e-ff06e539ef27">
      <Text>The heart needs a purpose, Jaca. Not just protein.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0b0f8480-1bef-4a9c-ae9b-b5de922c6357">
      <Text>Jaca retrieves a small, vacuum-sealed package and unwraps a pale, processed-looking piece of meat. They offer it to Gobi, who shakes their head.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f474a03c-fb81-4223-a3e9-ae97bfb67469">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="31a41602-cf0e-41ef-80b2-ab54ee3e7eab">
      <Text>I can't. It feels... heavy in a way I'm not used to anymore. A different kind of heavy than the meat in the vat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="14f5cbf1-32b7-4f4b-b636-ca5c738a556c">
      <Text>Gobi winces as the burn in their arm flares red.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a6354a4e-a069-4985-8377-dbb409440af2">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="04878cc7-98fb-472f-9370-d07f9cddd0ec">
      <Text>You need the friction of a real meal, Gobi, not just the abstract friction of a memory.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="36fc93b0-83d8-43d2-bb92-d1c4a184a1b3">
      <Text>Gobi looks at the raw protein in Jaca's hand, then back at the humming Bioreactor.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0680a617-0002-47ad-8305-87c9e6ec51a5">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="26f7072d-b405-4af7-b8b3-c296fc0418c4">
      <Text>The friction is in the work, Jaca. The computer keeps it alive, but it can’t keep it curious.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6779b9d1-c18c-401e-84c3-491f8a8ca1b8">
      <Text>Jaca pulls a small, sterile patch from their pocket and works to adjust Gobi's existing sensor.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="46cc876c-169b-444c-b3d5-df67cb32d62e">
      <Text>JaCA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3ff32e64-a831-4e59-a6f3-3054daf6f8cf">
      <Text>The answer is 1.0 density and a perfect sear. That’s what the Bio-License requires. Not... not pain.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="49458ba9-dea9-4248-b5ad-136aa42b0669">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e4aff8fb-e526-4431-8215-2198ce942a69">
      <Text>No pain, no rain.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="41275bde-d63e-48a5-8471-7dc20175bb5c">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9040b331-835c-42f9-8a18-a343d5992dae">
      <Text>I smell it. It’s the rain from the Great Wilding of ‘44. It’s supposed to trigger a release of oxytocin in the viewers.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4de65299-0c20-48f6-a3f3-c419f0a1c111">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="46d58141-7dca-4534-8642-ae8cec762bed">
      <Text>Ha! Oxytocin. Optimization. We’ve turned the weather into a sedative. I remember when rain smelled like wet pavement and desperation. I remember when it meant the harvest might fail. There was a stakes to the scent back then.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1abef3c4-3e0d-472a-9665-f18fc34203f6">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="bab11a64-e261-4b5b-9e8a-ccd63d2e169c">
      <Text>Stakes are just another word for instability. Why do you miss the anxiety of the Blood Era? My father spent forty years breathing through a charcoal filter because the stakes were too high.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7863a2ec-6e72-49b2-9c80-582dbe645cb2">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b270b667-458a-4310-9253-c86ee3c7cf34">
      <Text>I don’t miss the blood, kid. I miss the choice. In the Garden, everything is decided by an algorithm designed to keep our heart rates at a steady sixty beats per minute. Even this burger... the CEO wants it to be a "Harmonic Nutrient." They want people to eat it and feel... nothing. Just a quiet fullness.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e9054c43-1f56-4ed4-af79-4da258884bab">
      <Text>Jaca checks Gobi’s pulse.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a695dd36-c36f-4a28-82f8-44a404230624">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b3acfe8a-3efb-435d-8acb-2aa31e0ead14">
      <Text>And what do you want them to feel?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="54b06055-ad79-4d8a-a228-a1ced51c8b7b">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0086df3f-05ea-425d-b87b-32393923db42">
      <Text>I want them to feel the 2013 spec. I want them to feel the moment we stood in that London lab and realized we could change the destiny of the planet. I want them to feel the work.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="20f93c72-aaac-45f5-b8f9-5e78ea96c610">
      <Text>Gobi winces as the umbilical wire pulses a neon gold.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="389d13d4-7280-4bca-b431-e99b46527077">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0086df3f-05ea-425d-b87b-32393923db42">
      <Text>If they don't feel the work, they'll never value the peace.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="feca6da5-64a0-47b5-8d67-a95787d4a9d9">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b4c3d551-c679-4b8d-bbb2-7d0ee6c0d446">
      <Text>Your pulse is at eighty-five. You’re fighting the Garden’s rhythm.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f9611e5b-7dad-47b1-9cd3-cb95e940151e">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="08a47623-a9b0-489a-9f8e-05777ccaecef">
      <Text>I’m providing the friction, Jaca. Without friction, the meat is just... a cloud.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5b9185e2-3a9c-4df0-b520-271b19a34931">
      <Text>Gobi looks out at the rotating Earth.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b4d0a390-c696-4fdf-8a35-7f7cfbf98591">
      <Text>GoBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="08a47623-a9b0-489a-9f8e-05777ccaecef">
      <Text>We’re days out from the Jubilee. The CEO is already planning the global victory feast. They’ve invited the Wilding Ministers from four continents.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f934f7ee-ac99-4047-84f5-9b6e51a70570">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d8f2e6e6-85c1-45df-aa3b-8e90d61b4c92">
      <Text>They’re calling it the Feast of Mercy.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="fc14d17f-3154-4cd4-be55-edbb71343c19">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="006e6c60-499b-42ae-be0c-100a7016e417">
      <Text>Mercy is a heavy word with no backbone.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5f795fc2-7c64-40aa-ac31-f1b22449f4c4">
      <Text>Kneeling beside Gobi, Jaca’s hand hovers over the umbilical wire.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2b93aec2-3a06-408e-ab7a-b4742b045dcb">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="186d6433-f170-4c39-af57-be949d6c1f2d">
      <Text>The CEO sent a data-push while you were under. They’ve rebranded the 2013 London Burger as "The Harmonic Disc." They’ve stripped your name from the technical specifications, Gobi. They’re calling the biometric link a "Standardized </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Biosync</Text>
      <Text>."</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="265dcba6-371c-4ffb-9ad1-669cb877bc7a">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b95e0d42-804c-4029-bbb1-7c4035dd917c">
      <Text>Standardized. Like a heartbeat is just a line of code you can copy and paste. They want the "Sync," but they don't want the "Bio."</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b23642c5-2414-4627-af1f-ec9f697ea6e1">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="611c5062-1b05-4d91-9c99-6a51e330dc96">
      <Text>They’re terrified the world will find out that the meat still needs a person. They want to sell the idea that the Garden grows itself. If they admit that the 2013-spec only holds its density because you’re bleeding your adrenaline into the nutrient-mix, the "Meatless" dream collapses.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="81ce1a78-c642-4513-8e77-ccf8632ba8cc">
      <Text>Gobi opens their eyes and looks directly at Jaca.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1097591f-bebb-41ce-b335-58f3f720c90d">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ab9af248-2578-4161-b717-d20a24c70f79">
      <Text>The dream isn't collapsing, kid. It’s just finally waking up.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="85b10366-c72c-4f0a-bb33-21111efd424c">
      <Text>Gobi winces as the wire pulses a deep, rhythmic amber.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9b805d6f-7552-4285-9b97-d40fc43d17b3">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ab9af248-2578-4161-b717-d20a24c70f79">
      <Text>My father used to say that you don’t own a piece of land until you’ve bled into the dirt. I guess the same goes for the future.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e11b59fb-89ae-4e29-98d4-8d478e44d5d0">
      <Text>Jaca touches the warm glass of the bioreactor.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e2daa3ea-728c-46bb-b880-fd9ba222d35c">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="33da06df-4177-449c-9685-adf6427b7322">
      <Text>It’s heavy today. The density is 1.1. That’s higher than the 2013 record. Gobi... it’s not just mimicking a heart. It’s trying to be one.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3ba78467-d41e-4fd6-b169-eb08113f6b91">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ef3a0231-b31f-4e0b-ba27-fb3827d61ed4">
      <Text>That’s because it’s finally listening. For forty years, we told the cells to be "Pure-Fluid." We told them to be nothing. Now, for the first time, someone is telling them to be... persistent.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d3077a47-666f-402b-b4bf-f5d6d7a204c0">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="03854966-662a-44c9-9168-edd33c6b326e">
      <Text>My father called me this morning. He said the air in the Highland Zones is so clear it hurts his lungs. He doesn't know about the link, Gobi. He thinks I’m winning a Bio-License on my own merit.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="27fa8fe3-9468-4fce-bd08-005f7af74d15">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7ed29497-6147-4ac2-98fb-c5768759e347">
      <Text>You are winning it. You’re the one keeping the CEO from seeing the link. You’re the architect of the lie that lets the truth grow.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="520545e9-fb46-42af-86ba-0ac3cfa5af74">
      <Text>Gobi reaches out, their hand trembling, and touches Jaca’s wrist.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3dc02b2b-59a1-4797-8c65-6c2e754ebb3c">
      <Text>GobI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7ed29497-6147-4ac2-98fb-c5768759e347">
      <Text>But you’re starting to shiver too, Marrow Designer.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9b19cd9c-e68d-4d24-a666-138c9ab6b24c">
      <Text>Jaca’s hand trembles in sync with Gobi.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b480b118-468c-4da0-b0fe-2c8f57fd6a57">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="55f449b6-ccde-4506-80f0-c358aec69688">
      <Text>It’s just the oscillation of the station. The centrifugal force—</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ccc3241a-aaa1-4c7a-a133-a4a433a044fe">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a0ceb266-3ca5-4df1-aad0-3eb3ead0be42">
      <Text>It’s not the station, Jaca. It’s the handshake. The vat isn't just taking my rhythm anymore; it’s looking for a secondary core. It’s looking for you.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1376aacc-eab2-44b0-8f58-03d0d8466b29">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="bb80685a-2199-42c9-aa43-cc10610dc249">
      <Text>I am the Marrow Designer. I am the observer. I don’t link. If the CEO sees a dual-biometric signature on the Jubilee feed, we don’t just lose the license. They’ll "Recycle" the entire station. They’ll claim the Garden was contaminated by Unregulated Human Interference.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b814185c-b602-42ac-b39b-dc5c00e9667c">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="79e744f8-9802-4d38-8af8-674107703022">
      <Text>They already think we’re interference. That’s why they put us in a cage made of glass and lavender. The 2013-spec is hitting critical mass. It’s becoming too dense for the acoustic levitators to hold. It’s starting to drop, Jaca.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e2eb2052-6d3d-4544-8a88-19744e97babc">
      <Text>Jaca frantically swipe at the tablet.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d1f7b19a-0b9c-469c-8a3f-e5da83155dff">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3f517bd3-d2f1-405a-85b2-a3cf1dab3aa9">
      <Text>I can increase the frequency. I can boost the magnets—</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="28e5e3f7-7a59-4283-aa9a-0b1625303539">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="af9e1bf8-3125-4bfb-bb3b-e4110a145c6c">
      <Text>You can’t boost gravity. The meat wants to be heavy. It wants to hit the plate with a beat that the world can hear. If you keep it "Meatless," you’re just serving them another soap bubble.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="eecf29b1-2e61-4bbb-8b2b-5e6194e42e09">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="-0.10" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.00" RightIndent="5.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Parenthetical" id="4d93244a-9419-41b7-9521-d019b5f54270">
      <Text>(Turning on Gobi, fierce)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7847cf40-115b-4c4b-804e-f372e27a8c87">
      <Text>A soap bubble keeps my father breathing! A soap bubble is the reason we don’t have to kill anything! Why are you so obsessed with the "Beat"?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c8da2670-ed79-4f12-a298-4d152cb2625d">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a624f870-37c5-414f-8c45-648c70e22e11">
      <Text>Because the "Beat" is the only thing that proves we were here. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="54e3bf86-197d-48fa-89d3-b2805baad0dd">
      <Text>Gobi reaches for the umbilical wire, their fingers hovering over the release valve.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7811e920-9d9d-4030-a197-f611856badb4">
      <Text>GobI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a624f870-37c5-414f-8c45-648c70e22e11">
      <Text>We’re a week from High Noon. The CEO is already prepping the Global Reset protocols. They want a clean harvest, Jaca. A silent one.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="bb2c2316-546c-4f81-82ee-c3d7cad1e321">
      <Text>Jaca steps towards the bioreactor.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8b37411c-4370-4324-96b0-9c702b417e37">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2170bbea-2684-4021-9133-d6eccfa267b1">
      <Text>Then let it be silent. Let it be perfect. Just... let us survive it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0ddc2eef-fbda-466e-a654-bb1a04e89c6b">
      <Text>A low-frequency hum vibrates through the mossy floor. The Bioreactor flares with a sudden, violent amber light.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a9972ddc-5462-48a3-acf3-e0923b010378">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a8f6a591-001d-4cce-addf-b9307cc9cf3f">
      <Text>The acoustic fields are buckling! Gobi, the density is at 1.5. It’s over-calcifying. The cells... they aren't just mimicking the 2013-spec, they’re fossilizing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e5f34cfc-7310-4e93-b85f-af614270f506">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a59e5bd6-9d0b-4041-8161-ffe50e87aedc">
      <Text>It’s not fossilizing. It’s... anchoring. It’s trying to find a center of gravity in a room that was built to deny it. Jaca, the CEO is spiking the levitation frequencies. They’re trying to force it back into a cloud.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="bb9d9be0-90d5-4bba-ab2a-c0a6e256e02c">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e2dc35da-d188-49c6-bfdc-f7dda89803cf">
      <Text>I’m seeing a data-collision! The CEO is flooding the nutrient valves with soy-stabilizers—they’re trying to mask your biometric signature before the World Food Summit sensors lock on. They want a clean product, Gobi! A silent product!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c1571de3-9e6a-4b84-932c-4d1ae8975f42">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="741c9c97-277b-4868-8275-2fbe950af0cd">
      <Text>Contaminate? I’m the only thing in this tank that isn't a lie! You want a Meatless burger? Then why does the world feel so heavy, Boss?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="47b900a2-713d-4516-a3d8-4173ff95a0f1">
      <Text>The mossy floor begins to pulse with a violent, rhythmic red light. The harmonic chime of the station is replaced by a jagged, high-pitched acoustic alarm.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fad0c84b-c017-4ccd-b2d2-5483d233bff0">
      <Text>Jaca checks Gobi’s vitals. They are redlining.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="acd3c599-f15b-461f-993c-af580e211798">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4bdc4426-8062-43c1-baf6-c58c5366b7ee">
      <Text>Gobi, stop. Your blood pressure is hitting the stroke-zone. The wire... it’s glowing, Gobi. It’s pulling more than just your pulse- </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">your heat</Text>
      <Text>. You’re becoming the oven!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b1b0cea6-2059-452c-a04a-447945e31c8e">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f2aa8871-ce8e-4831-82e3-dbd6fabd43f8">
      <Text>Five days... Jaca. Don't let them... un-link us.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="42480c85-bd4d-4acb-b3b1-3d747f81112e">
      <Text>A moment of hesitation, then a decisive movement. They rip a bundle of wires from the decorative lighting and jam them into the bioreactor's power port.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d354ba7f-9d50-4888-8727-c9db3c472269">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f67c8602-8740-40a3-b92b-993690943637">
      <Text>I’m slaving the station’s main oxygen-scrubbers to the vat’s cooling system. If the CEO tries to purge you, they’ll have to suffocate the whole Orbital Garden to do it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="bab92988-63a1-47fe-8552-3fb7da478a46">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0b694c9e-d3e0-4f3d-bb94-67e7d3c6e546">
      <Text>Now that’s... some aggressive architecture.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3a5a05d6-ca87-429c-9b67-c45503e6de27">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="-0.10" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.00" RightIndent="5.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Parenthetical" id="0e10ac01-2bf4-498a-b535-8d9bd9ee5e41">
      <Text>(to the jumbotron)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f6219553-e771-4144-86c8-653aba3a45d6">
      <Text>They’re cutting the feeds. They’re trying to segment the broadcast so the colonies only see a scenesimulation. Gobi, they’re erasing the struggle in real-time!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="fd1364e8-aa97-407e-8fc8-d0030feb536f">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="addfed6f-7ba8-420f-b065-c69e8b66af02">
      <Text>Let them segment the data. They can’t segment the vibration. Jaca... link in. Not for the license. Not for the air. For the truth.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="80ba6508-77e6-4fea-9b66-d82d659ecabe">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="83d88ba5-e03c-4d89-ac07-1fa65f004604">
      <Text>If I link, I can’t hide the signature anymore. We’ll be two ghosts screaming into a vacuum.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="baecc69d-9d15-4899-aa59-2f06f7432f6b">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5df0a661-337c-4437-a30a-84495c0582a0">
      <Text>But the world will hear the harmony. For forty years, they’ve lived in a Great Peace that was built on a whisper. Let’s give them a shout.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1128acf9-21a5-408b-8bd8-3552c42580d9">
      <Text>Jaca looks at the tablet. A notification flashes: OXYGEN DEBT CLEARED. WELCOME TO THE HIGHLAND ZONES. Jaca stares at it for a beat, then with a jagged, defiant motion, they swipe the notification into the trash. They rip open their sleeve and slap the secondary sensor onto their forearm.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e6579e1d-fbf9-4a90-869f-8cfa097c27bd">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="246df1ed-6561-4d91-a1a9-287cce90bbd4">
      <Text>God... it’s... it’s heavy.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5ff0882a-875e-4072-a7ee-cc24ff615732">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7a230813-da23-4480-9b64-eee3dfe90e6b">
      <Text>That’s how you know... it’s real.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8693c6b5-6e87-4480-97ed-d29fd9faaaa1">
      <Text>A resonant </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">beat</Text>
      <Text> vibrates the floorplates as the two heartbeats synchronize. The Bioreactor flares with a brilliant, unified amber light that overpowers the Garden's clinical glow. The Jumbotron timer snaps to 10:00.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2bf50b56-0262-4b87-9c85-f7f4ac07b057">
      <Text>ANNOUNCER (V.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="cf71c549-c721-46ac-b39e-dc27bff00f82">
      <Text>Ten minutes to harvest! Diez </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">minutos</Text>
      <Text>! The world food summit is tuned to the orbital garden! Citizens, are you ready to feel the future?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="dd0571e1-1887-451d-831f-2c5952e59e64">
      <Text>Jaca and Gobi stand silhouetted against the blinding light of the Sun, two cultivators tethered to a piece of meat that is finally starting to beat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="649d1919-2e08-4e31-b3a6-748469fb64b3">
      <Text>Black out.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="End of Act" id="08536e41-1a30-4a93-a2de-c23282464060">
      <Text Style="Underline+AllCaps">End of Act </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Style="Underline+AllCaps">II</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="New Act" id="5c27492e-c03e-4a50-8c99-ad9c114c1b65">
      <Text Style="Underline+AllCaps">Act </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Style="Underline+AllCaps">III</Text>
      <Text Style="Underline+AllCaps">: The Past Mold</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Info" id="af681496-bc4f-416e-bc09-1ed582588156">
      <Text>Scene 1</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="52682852-794e-4139-9e7f-c424e19b51de">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 2/8" Page="38" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="MENTOR">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="YOUNG GOBI">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>London Kitchen</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="71ae5ac5-2341-4f0b-b881-805b22f586df">
      <Text>2013.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="71ae5ac5-2341-4f0b-b881-805b22f586df">
      <Text>The stage is a dimly lit lab bench in an old-world laboratory. A much younger Gobi, late teens, is focused on a bioreactor with an old-time burger. Gobi's superior, known simply as </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Mentor</Text>
      <Text>, oversees from a monitor.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7b3e432c-8ff2-4b45-80cc-bc79a4ce1c62">
      <Text>Young Gobi</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="2489ab81-d387-4628-b58f-db204bbe0fc3">
      <Text>(to the audience)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f146941f-cc7a-453b-bd72-ee0e7eb37ffe">
      <Text>2013. They say this is the future. A three-hundred-thousand-euro confession. We call it the London Burger. It’s protein, grown from a single cell. No kill. No blood. No beat. The world is holding its breath. We have one shot to change everything. One bite to create a merciful world.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="7e5b22ab-4619-4afa-9cba-23e67da8a700">
      <Text>(to Mentor)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e2a94fa9-37fd-4ce4-bec0-df5f8eff06a0">
      <Text>This better be a something burger and not a nothing burger.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0d370954-7ac5-4aa6-b1b6-0ae42bd8c1c5">
      <Text>Mentor (V.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="923f2d06-36f7-4360-9f71-3d777b1f1a64">
      <Text>It will work, Gobi. The media event is booked for August 5th. Sergey Brin is expecting a burger, not a scientific apology. We're addressing global food security, not your existential dread.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="56b6d0ae-c190-4e5a-8f23-a39ac6e85c68">
      <Text>Gobi cooks.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="31783592-ea44-40c4-bbec-1afe3157a76a">
      <Text>MenTOR (V.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3655e27f-f786-4b4b-a192-8c4eec74b6a5">
      <Text>The color, Gobi. It's too white. We need myoglobin, or the chef will have nothing to fry. Add the beetroot juice and saffron mix.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1c61db20-69a4-4703-bf9d-5698dbf8f6da">
      <Text>YoUNG Gobi</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d1ef2f89-8917-4779-8891-b32f73edfd88">
      <Text>It'll taste like dirt and a spice rack. Not meat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4d233363-cf44-48b6-9d8c-a47e82d70e19">
      <Text>MENTOR (V.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="55faeb9d-40f8-4605-b13e-f4702360ad4c">
      <Text>Add the colorants. We need it to look like a burger. Perception is half the grant money.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e1f0e894-9e2f-4d97-a65e-745594b14b88">
      <Text>Gobi sighs, adding the mix. The liquid in the vat turns an unnatural red.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f7812bac-7f10-4444-9e4a-0924c380fd10">
      <Text>Mentor (V.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8755eb74-85b8-4037-bd5d-6b6da58f0595">
      <Text>Gobi, the temperature gauge on the main incubator is spiking. We're losing two years of cell lines!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d894843b-1d3c-473b-a692-b08a06caf1b8">
      <Text>Young GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0e94f231-241c-41e9-9189-b9e10b0aba64">
      <Text>Vent the oxygen! Siphon the nutrient mix! We can't lose the samples. We're so close!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f99f8a8c-e101-4ff3-9d5d-a23419bd0570">
      <Text>Gobi works frantically to save the culture.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Info" id="af681496-bc4f-416e-bc09-1ed582588156">
      <Text>Scene 2</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="52682852-794e-4139-9e7f-c424e19b51de">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 2/8" Page="39" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="YOUNG GOBI">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Apartment</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="046f5df2-9ff5-4d96-8e8f-a98f998a36f9">
      <Text>August 4, 2013. 3AM.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="046f5df2-9ff5-4d96-8e8f-a98f998a36f9">
      <Text>The only light comes from the streetlights filtering through a window and the LED of a tablet on a desk.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1a469c8d-2e7c-4ce0-beb0-735684201dcf">
      <Text>Gobi, wearing a t-shirt and sweats, sits at the desk. They are staring at the tablet, which displays complex cell culture data and a diagram of the lab's bioreactor.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d6df0db3-b38b-4c86-845e-be94757aca76">
      <Text>YOUNG GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e32e56f4-5eaf-4f57-8ff0-b612ece4d9a7">
      <Text>The silence is deafening. In the lab, it's just the hum of the machines and the quiet fizz of the nutrient mix. No lowing. No feathers ruffling. Just... clean, clinical silence.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="41092c74-4301-481f-b001-72de79de8840">
      <Text>Gobi swipes the tablet, a schematic of the lab burger filling the display.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d20458a3-4c38-4da3-b41c-f6a0668d89ce">
      <Text>YOUNG GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5f2341f8-7501-4488-ac90-65cf22432484">
      <Text>“No kill.” “Mercy with every bite.” That's the slogan. But is it mercy if you just erase the memory of what was lost? If you pretend the whole thing never had a heartbeat to begin with?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="96588cad-8d33-438f-8111-e1a4491ccb64">
      <Text>They lean back in their chair, rubbing their eyes. They look deeply unsettled.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="44e04e63-d244-4461-82d3-f2ee931b4e7a">
      <Text>YOUNG GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="fb01497f-83ff-4a9b-90c4-98ec5e5bb4a4">
      <Text>I love farms. Since I was a kid. The smell of the dirt, the sound of the cattle... heavy. Real. This burger... it's just a line of code. A beautiful, delicious lie that was built on a terror we’re all too happy to forget.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9edd9d81-1c4b-443d-932e-52793dd7d8a0">
      <Text>Gobi gets up and pace the small room, their bare feet silent on the floor.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6a8afc04-70d4-41ea-9b86-0ed358fd9d74">
      <Text>YOUNG GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9278763f-017e-4c03-9907-ad4a1f81f5a8">
      <Text>They want me to add colorant so it "looks" real. So it can be a brand. A brand isn't a heartbeat. A brand is just an absence of something else.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="53e0a12c-1538-41e8-aea6-c7378516f67c">
      <Text>Gobi stops at the window, looking out at the sterile city below. They make a decision.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="793a81ca-3f4f-4100-bd7e-973a06c5a35d">
      <Text>YOUNG GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9b5eb94f-3b2e-49dc-ac8b-fd4ed5bbcbe9">
      <Text>I need to see the cost. I need to remember the weight before it’s a cloud.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="93eedcea-4172-4d9a-b0e3-204ff8eb22a2">
      <Text>Gobi moves quickly, grabbing their sketchbook and pulling on their shoes. They open the door.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Info" id="af681496-bc4f-416e-bc09-1ed582588156">
      <Text>Scene 3</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="52682852-794e-4139-9e7f-c424e19b51de">
      <SceneProperties Length="2" Page="40" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="BUTCHER">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="YOUNG GOBI">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>London Street</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="92ca5e8b-d039-44d7-a86c-0537f7ccb8d4">
      <Text>August 4, 2013. Mid-afternoon.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="92ca5e8b-d039-44d7-a86c-0537f7ccb8d4">
      <Text>The street is busy, a mix of modern architecture and older, slightly run-down buildings. SOUND of moderate city traffic, distant chatter.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="517877aa-bddf-4933-96c2-463d08b6776b">
      <Text>Gobi, in casual clothes, walks with purpose, a sketchbook in hand. They look stressed, preoccupied.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4a8bcc18-34bd-48b9-82e7-36ec1e842498">
      <Text>They stop outside a small, old-fashioned BUTCHER SHOP. The window is cluttered with meat displays and hand-written signs.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="cdde0e19-7bd2-4a41-998e-b5eca8958dd7">
      <Text>YOUNG GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="251716a9-0de5-47db-898f-0530b6815e7b">
      <Text>(to the audience)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="01594e74-9981-4e79-9d5e-ea229c3c68fa">
      <Text>I needed to see something real. The lab felt like a tomb. Clean, quiet, and dead. They wanted a miracle, but miracles are messy, aren't they? They leave scars.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="cead2075-8933-4464-8a55-0eaf6da857ef">
      <Text>Gobi stares intently at a small, framed photograph taped next to a price list in the shop window. It’s a simple picture of a COW standing in a field.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d7d74b61-fd12-461b-bef8-20b88b2abdb4">
      <Text>A </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">butcher</Text>
      <Text> exits the shop, wiping their hands on a stained apron. They notice Gobi staring at the photo.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5ef1ff3a-4c76-4c10-b041-576eb883139d">
      <Text>BUTCHER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="63bcc52d-4671-4506-8eed-3717b5a64a0b">
      <Text>Something I can help you with? That picture's not for sale. Belonged to my granddad.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="de70a6fa-1ba8-46a8-9aea-9131d740a2e4">
      <Text>YOUNG GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="914e46bf-9d6c-4bff-b3ca-9eb19ecdc4b6">
      <Text>Oh. No. Just... the cow.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="833a3bd6-f991-423e-887b-1c1ba162175b">
      <Text>BUTCHER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="158ad016-5451-4300-93c4-44e0496b9c48">
      <Text>A fine animal. Before the big farms took over everything. They had a heartbeat, you know.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0487d203-eb2e-48b2-bcb1-8920fef8c63e">
      <Text>YOUNG GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3825ba89-3e42-47f6-bbdd-a63db9a96ef3">
      <Text>A beat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="383fa32a-ccc0-408b-9538-a33fc96ed2dc">
      <Text>BUTCHER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4b958360-76ea-4aa5-9d5c-79094e2531e8">
      <Text>Yeah. My granddad always said if you can't feel the weight of what you're eating, you don't value the meal. People forget that. They want it easy.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7949c5df-9f63-491c-9069-3598df18729e">
      <Text>YOUNG GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b6dfb9e7-a4d8-4ea2-b2f8-1bc12cd366ec">
      <Text>They want to forget the terror.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d910731a-b6f1-4aa3-b5d2-e1da094d186b">
      <Text>BUTCHER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="-0.10" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.00" RightIndent="5.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Parenthetical" id="e0ac0164-a6a1-40d6-a837-02f1fd3b6c8c">
      <Text>(squinting)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a0f71738-7778-4b2b-bf85-934bdc565838">
      <Text>Maybe. Or maybe they just want a burger without feeling guilty. This one wasn't about guilt. It was about respect.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e5fd8ea2-db6a-4753-83c8-f5b54b0a7c50">
      <Text>The Butcher rips the photograph off the window and offers it to Gobi.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d8e5d914-41ac-4434-b57d-29b35086b485">
      <Text>BUTCHER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5b9d8922-4253-48fd-aad6-caedba5b50ec">
      <Text>You look like you need it more than I do. The future's coming, they say. I hear we won't need butchers soon.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="caaa3fba-a754-4bd8-a3ce-f8b3337149b6">
      <Text>YOUNG GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c0f3c419-a237-4f60-bcc4-5e58bb86adb8">
      <Text>Thanks.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="163094de-b9b5-4844-a558-fe58d840f767">
      <Text>BUTCHER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6746f1f0-5510-4afb-8935-01f6f21bc819">
      <Text>Don't mention it. Good luck with... whatever you're doing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d0b772f8-c442-413b-a776-c745ac27e27a">
      <Text>The Butcher goes inside. Gobi stands alone on the street, holding the picture. They clench it in their fist, the paper crinkling slightly. The distant city noise fades, replaced by the faint sound of a heartbeat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5005cadd-8ab3-4d78-9363-77595c4a97ff">
      <Text>YOUNG GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0a7473ba-73ca-4834-a161-ab2561a41d33">
      <Text>I will spend the rest of my life making sure the miracle has a backbone.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a8ea929f-6006-4998-84b7-2aa45dd997d4">
      <Text>Gobi places the photo carefully in their pocket and walks off, a determined look on their face.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8d3b687e-6ce8-4b53-86d0-659786c0240b">
      <Text>Black out.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Info" id="af681496-bc4f-416e-bc09-1ed582588156">
      <Text>Scene 4</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="52682852-794e-4139-9e7f-c424e19b51de">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 4/8" Page="42" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="GOBI">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="MENTOR">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>London Studio</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f07939e7-c13f-4fe2-8d29-6eb8a1a1bc07">
      <Text>August 5, 2013. Noon.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="892e8c24-faa1-4717-8df1-5e01eb3a5f5a">
      <Text>The space is a cramped, messy backstage lab area, dimly lit by a single utilitarian light. A TV monitor flickers silently in the background, showing the brightly lit stage of the tasting event, currently empty.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="29c26bac-2e5e-4f8d-987d-1030c49f0c61">
      <Text>Gobi is alone. They hold a stringy piece of the lab-grown meat. They stare at it intently, turning it over in their hands.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ba7a238c-91ad-4c25-abc5-c8c47a887804">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="-0.10" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.00" RightIndent="5.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Parenthetical" id="992a2e24-b629-4c47-b702-ee031d2700e9">
      <Text>(to the audience)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ab56b733-87f7-42f1-a8f1-8afd444b7625">
      <Text>They want a miracle. The world is holding its breath for a miracle on a bun.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8d714d2f-2df5-4241-837e-4cb3deafebe4">
      <Text>They bring the piece of protein close to their ear, listening to it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="fd3a58ee-726f-47c0-be48-d43eff1d9694">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0abe1821-d61f-4aa5-befa-a6be69fc262a">
      <Text>But it's silent. No life. No heart. A clean, clinical absence of a beat. We did it. We stopped the killing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b463eda8-f32f-4e78-bb0e-2da2fba9e87f">
      <Text>They look up at the silent monitor, where an announcer is gesticulating, though we cannot hear the sound.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="87263684-df71-4eb9-8549-a37c817c8ad0">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f1c68078-ff5f-4f47-ac6b-085281db38de">
      <Text>And what was the cost? We traded the slaughterhouse for the foundry, and the Earth breathed back. But a world without hunger is a world that forgets. They'll eat this, and they'll feel... nothing. Just a quiet fullness, built on a lie that it was easy.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e4be6789-fa91-493a-b057-2f5f0a629dd0">
      <Text>They clench the protein in their fist, with a pained expression.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f32b25c8-2fb1-4c5a-b475-f47641ac6d63">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="15ace91d-b753-42a3-91de-f0616a2b936e">
      <Text>I wanted mercy. I wanted the promise. But a promise without friction is just a dream. This... this is just a cloud. I will spend the rest of my life making sure the miracle has a backbone. Even if I have to break the machine to do it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a69ccf03-6e9f-40c1-8265-ee4ae14b17ad">
      <Text>A frantic voice is heard from </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Mentor</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e80ad0dd-6ec8-4983-adc9-f01209118090">
      <Text>Mentor (V.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e241ec93-b2bd-4c37-9033-42d972ec86d3">
      <Text>Gobi! They're waiting! Bring the sample!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c482794d-f5ff-4966-b5f3-f94ac1a76912">
      <Text>Gobi looks at the door, then back at the protein in their hand. They opens their hand and gently places the muscle strands onto a plate. They pick up the plate, taking one last look at the silent monitor.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="95e037de-9913-481e-821d-4af30f8d078a">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2b602432-c820-4a9a-ae48-2bcccc58e7da">
      <Text>The truth needs a heartbeat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="468d4607-6063-47ea-aa14-0fe813e7d833">
      <Text>They exit. The screen suddenly snaps to a close-up of the burger.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Info" id="af681496-bc4f-416e-bc09-1ed582588156">
      <Text>Scene 5</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="52682852-794e-4139-9e7f-c424e19b51de">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 5/8" Page="43" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="GOBI">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="MENTOR">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>London Studio</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6e286b86-fd90-4ae0-bdfa-e8b33a9c351b">
      <Text>August 5, 2013. Evening.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6984ecfa-ad65-4b7e-a0b5-0c0b6ee07dba">
      <Text>The room is dark. Gobi sits on a crate, staring at a photograph in their hand. Their phone rings. They answer.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3a8bd7c3-f312-4442-830f-6880bc110516">
      <Text>MENTOR (V.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="96523782-393a-4af4-868f-097c3970da71">
      <Text>I thought you went home. The metrics are good, Gobi. The press is calling it a "culinary leap forward."</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0363f201-4db8-487b-96d0-9c60c0c7dc9f">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="-0.10" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.00" RightIndent="5.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Parenthetical" id="94948da3-7865-4624-abb9-120d76c5117f">
      <Text>(Bitterly)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7c9f88dc-33a0-4f2c-a065-f71b366f3d12">
      <Text>"Clean meat." They also called it an "animal-protein cake." We did it, though. We fed the world an absence of guilt.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="76e409f7-eca1-42da-9577-af1f1ae77782">
      <Text>MENTOR (V.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="89b79279-8276-4611-a443-60399815007d">
      <Text>It's a brand, Gobi. A brand is how you change the world. This technology eliminates slaughter. That is the greatest act of mercy in human history.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="841ea356-5b50-4cdb-9b48-a2af19341aa2">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="09359e2e-6a1e-4c90-8c27-19074b18285b">
      <Text>Mercy is a heavy word with no backbone. They want the feeling, but they don't want the memory of its risks...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6a148f42-f94d-4077-a87e-3a270103aecc">
      <Text>MENTOR (V.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a3088236-fb4b-4889-9ff4-216d5cb8fe32">
      <Text>I know the story. You felt the weight. That feeling is why we are here, Gobi. To ensure no one else has to feel it. Now, go home. The design on the Foundry starts tomorrow.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0a697f47-37c4-49b2-b858-19b2a9d29c53">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="677593a6-e0cb-4991-aa11-4f66db415d0a">
      <Text>We're going to build the Cloud. Fine. But the next time we do this, the world is going to feel something real. Pain is the only thing that makes it real.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e42eb938-c88e-4be3-bbc8-6206e088ffbb">
      <Text>MENTOR (V.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="79d5ef5f-5b1f-4325-8f62-6f3ef5504de8">
      <Text>It will feel full, Gobi. That's enough.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="528c114b-ece6-44d5-881d-ad96589d0490">
      <Text>Gobi hangs up the phone without another word. They look at the photograph, then put it into his pocket. A look of quiet, dangerous resolve settles on their face.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2ee9fdbf-7758-400f-a009-d3072e14b564">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="-0.10" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.00" RightIndent="5.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Parenthetical" id="c370edc1-8378-4155-b10a-4d6c785ea0bb">
      <Text>(to the audience)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2bb76f18-4286-4cf5-981b-9d84a57124d5">
      <Text>To be frank... They just want us to forget. Forget that beat sound when something real becomes your dinner. They want this quiet world where everything's all clean and nothing ever has to die just so it can taste good. A world without that weight? It’s a flimsy dream.
</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ac89491a-a766-4086-8b0d-e1bd602e3b7f">
      <Text>I remember the smell of the grill that night. The juice. It just felt like this big lie, built on actual terror. So I made this thing to forget that terror. But if you forget the terror, you forget the value. You forget the heartbeat.
</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="fbb8c48c-a897-463f-abf0-65128ae2c722">
      <Text>This new meat... I mean, it's a cool science experiment and all, but it has no soul. It has no history to, like, chew on. It's just... nothing. I'm not gonna let that be the legacy. No way. The world needs to hear the impact. The world needs to remember where food comes from. They need to know what a meal actually costs.
</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9e5dd95d-ad94-41b8-802f-95d6e250b6d5">
      <Text>I am the future, I guess, and the future needs a spine.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="649d1919-2e08-4e31-b3a6-748469fb64b3">
      <Text>Black out.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Info" id="af681496-bc4f-416e-bc09-1ed582588156">
      <Text>Scene 6</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.50" RightIndent="7.50" SpaceBefore="24" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Scene Heading" id="b0e61be8-d61c-4d26-a0c5-e6117d047de5">
      <SceneProperties Length="2 6/8" Page="45" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LIBRARIAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="YOUNG GOBI">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="YOUNG JACA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>THE LIBRARY ARCHIVE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="09f506cc-5ded-4fd3-918b-410d2744062a">
      <Text>2053.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="cea70fcc-b9e8-481d-b52b-c5d7d965ac2a">
      <Text>The library observation deck is quiet, just the low hum of the clean air system. 14-year-old Jaca is totally sucked into a giant screen, flicking through old data about the planet.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="80d60b2b-c0b8-4b0f-8432-d247a8cb2a94">
      <Text>YOUNG JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="040b19bd-3167-499c-862b-662d3bae506d">
      <Text>Okay, so the air is chill. Methane? Gone. Water systems are all perfect now. Sweet.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="89017051-2f8a-4c60-9bf4-12eb88231439">
      <Text>Jaca swipes the screen, pulling up some really old, messy footage of a place that used to farm animals. The pictures are all crazy and chaotic. Jaca just keeps watching, looking all clinical.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e79a79ae-2e3c-4c72-9bd3-536b87f4c507">
      <Text>YOUNG JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="85dab958-ac63-4d7e-9d9d-0bca44167732">
      <Text>Seriously? Look at this mess. They called it The Blood Era. Talk about an absolute dumpster fire. People just went with this madness? Wild.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="43eddf94-a772-4ecc-b366-632fe5e7f57b">
      <Text>Jaca swipes again, bringing up text data on an “Oxygen Audit.” A red line flashes: "DEBT OWED: 3 MONTHS."</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="28ad76d3-5a0a-4864-bb30-c183f83d5c11">
      <Text>YouNG JaCA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3a9fd3f4-fb0c-4596-a73c-a1bd9ae65b42">
      <Text>Wild isn't having to think about the air you breathe every second.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a224b9ec-f1a4-4423-9b12-be016993c632">
      <Text>Jaca minimizes the audit screen, the red light still a reflection in their eyes. They go back to the archival footage of a farm. A cow moos, the sound loud in the silent library. Jaca stares at the screen, a tremor starting in their hands. They lean closer to the screen, the sound of the animal an unwelcome weight in the quiet room.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d4699cd7-7822-428d-848d-efa044f75dae">
      <Text>YOUNG JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="36d3cfd6-6545-4962-995f-55bcddb51c08">
      <Text>My dad's lungs hurt. He coughs all day, every day. He works in the Mid-Zones. He can't afford the clean air up here in the Highland Zones... this is why we built the world like this, isn't it? To make the noise stop. To make the fear go away.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="243e6835-5729-46b5-96eb-63a32b66d5b6">
      <Text>Jaca watches as a silhouette of a person approaches the cow on the screen. The footage is blurry, but the implication is clear. Jaca flinches, swiping the screen violently to a blank, white corporate logo.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9e6b39b5-7282-42e5-8246-cb90ca99d65c">
      <Text>YOUNG GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4d5edb16-2c53-4233-8594-2c9063286762">
      <Text>It wasn't just the meat. It was the air. The water. The noise. The weight of it all. Gobi misses the weight... but the weight is what keeps my dad tethered to a machine.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9f42e5ef-fda3-4317-8bd0-aea1c97cf39c">
      <Text>A holographic librarian figure glides nearby or is on screen.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="82e31700-7e6f-4e64-bbce-711fbf289695">
      <Text>Librarian (V.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="fced2212-d59e-447e-abe5-61f3d200dd5d">
      <Text>Everything alright, Jaca? The Blood Era archives can be... intense. They say the air on the ground used to hurt your lungs back then.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="668e25ce-3a7c-4d56-9729-dec92fe610be">
      <Text>YouNG JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="412f7f97-86b5-49e4-bff5-7fda96bdb9d4">
      <Text>My dad lives in the Mid-Zones. His oxygen debt is three months overdue. He breathes a... discounted atmosphere.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9180e9f4-d12c-4e9c-a7fc-ac8c3e6df118">
      <Text>Librarian (V.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0f72be8e-42da-4ecd-b189-7d5910c40e61">
      <Text>Oh. I'm sorry to hear that. The system isn't seamless for everyone yet, I know. But we're getting there. Can I assist with your analysis of the Great Peace architecture?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1a676b67-1230-4db9-a411-b56ce1351b06">
      <Text>YOUNG JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4f650755-b66c-4892-8fbe-37cb7c11e339">
      <Text>The Cloud Protein license is our ticket to a better world, right? No more mess. No more... terror.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7301e8ca-331d-46a0-9d0d-78e05aaaac17">
      <Text>Librarian (V.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="546e2a41-5874-4730-8e50-834de5c9cb34">
      <Text>No more a heartbeat you can't ignore.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2b9e44d4-b496-4768-a0f6-0743d8233e6c">
      <Text>Jaca pulls up an article from Dr. Gobi.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5815acea-70db-473d-8d5f-2c5c3ae586de">
      <Text>YOUNG JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="69212fb9-20e3-411b-87bb-1e6f1d22abd2">
      <Text>“Mercy is a heavy word with no backbone.” What even is that? That's some serious corporate mumbo-jumbo, trying to make peace sound bad.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f81b3c94-22a9-4a9e-b4c2-ec10e69c4ca2">
      <Text>LIBRARIAN (V.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="cf2cf85b-40ad-4e56-993f-edc5f376bf6f">
      <Text>Outdated philosophy, Jaca. Modern behavioral science indicates that the absence of anxiety is a primary component of a happy and productive life. The current system ensures security over struggle.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a7cbe65c-91e8-4254-856d-46143d51d6e0">
      <Text>Jaca nods, seriously. They start dragging the old, messy history into a folder called “Garbage.”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="bc954084-016c-4f5d-a141-3df0c66d598d">
      <Text>Young JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6f46d320-7da4-424f-b914-229fce5963a8">
      <Text>Security is everything. The past was a total fail. The struggle isn't deep; it's just a broken system they finally fixed. That old way is totally canceled.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c2dcdfd6-1e76-46d9-bd98-cb5eac4ee056">
      <Text>Jaca finishes organizing, adding a new label to the “Biometric Syncing” file: “Vibes”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="00ee0d14-fdec-409e-a3ea-61312667ecb0">
      <Text>YOUNG JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="bcc32482-3f29-4f2f-a2e2-2b775391db25">
      <Text>My dad can breathe easy because of this new world. I need to keep it that way. No drama, just good tech and clear air. All that other stuff? It's just background noise.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="077212a8-12bb-49a3-ad0d-3d962af87145">
      <Text>Jaca minimizes the history files and starts a fresh design for some food garden in space. They look out the window at the peaceful planet below.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ac18bbeb-217e-43b8-8a16-cbf2d9ba6cdc">
      <Text>YOUNG JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ce71702c-70cf-4e52-ad13-60405da2c2e4">
      <Text>I'm not here for some deep life lesson. I'm here for a secure system. The future is clean, quiet, and totally lit.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ddfe092a-481e-4883-b5b1-6f6791454631">
      <Text>Black out.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="End of Act" id="e59886e7-d65c-4ca0-8ab9-512738521c07">
      <Text Style="Underline+AllCaps">End of Act </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Style="Underline+AllCaps">III</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="New Act" id="5c27492e-c03e-4a50-8c99-ad9c114c1b65">
      <Text Style="Underline+AllCaps">Act IV: The Burger Jubilee</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="927f8d02-e0ff-4157-af6c-ef42d65c0c5e">
      <SceneProperties Length="8 1/8" Page="49" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ANNOUNCER">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="CEO">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="GOBI">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="JACA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>The Orbital Foundry</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4cea8a59-2c41-40d9-9ed4-be8aff79b87b">
      <Text>August 5, 2063.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fa1d1ec1-c5ca-4aae-8ef7-c26ef518f09a">
      <Text>The Gravity-Well Grill. A cramped, semi-legal food stand attached to the outer hull of the Orbital Foundry. The space is a claustrophobic mess of hanging wires, dented counters, and a flickering neon sign that reads: Boneless (Mercy with Every Bite).</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4cea8a59-2c41-40d9-9ed4-be8aff79b87b">
      <Text>The Earth is outside. The stage vibrates with the roar of the exhaust vents. Bioreactor </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">XY</Text>
      <Text> has been replaced by a battered, transparent vat sitting on a grease-stained counter.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="91719825-9cd5-48f1-962b-eab524506f4a">
      <Text>The Jumbotron snaps to a massive countdown timer visible to the planet: 21:00.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="52d70946-7374-4dbf-b627-73924c800fbb">
      <Text>A split stage. Two isolated pools of light. Jaca is manically wiping down a tray of grease. They are wearing a frayed corporate uniform. Gobi is slumped on a crate behind the counter. A glowing blue umbilical wire leads from a sensor on their chest into the vat. They are drinking from a pouch.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7d2165ac-34a4-4a3c-8fd4-c143e5b91721">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="d0bfdae4-ca39-4c53-8541-9abcebc446d8">
      <Text>(to the audience)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6db81d55-0f6b-43fb-b8d4-74f79af5cf7c">
      <Text>Welcome to the Gravity Well! Five billion views and counting! We aren't just serving a normal burger today, but the 2013 London! The beginning of the No Kill Era. Come for the Cloud, stay for the Mercy.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f3766fd6-7ea9-4e0a-8dd9-220bac0e98e3">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="c268d3cb-978a-4289-ae13-e74ea8d34765">
      <Text>(to the audience)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6fe5f4f9-e686-48af-ae47-c41c4e722256">
      <Text>Five billion souls watching a food stand. They want a sensational story, not history. Six weeks I’ve spent as a human battery for this grease-trap. The machine is thirsty, and my rhythm is the only currency that hasn't devalued. Jaca thinks they’re the driver of a global movement, but they’re just flipping ghosts in a zero-G frying pan...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2a91a357-93f5-40d9-8a08-db0a3ef184c4">
      <Text>A blinding glare of sunlight hits the station. A bass drop.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="039ec952-6fac-42ae-8a3d-3c6d00c7a167">
      <Text>ANNOUNCER (V.O.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c56e738b-3592-4197-be2a-89e5411abef8">
      <Text>Citizens of Earth!</Text>
      <Text Font="Sans Mono CJK Final Draft"> ¡</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Ciudadanos</Text>
      <Text> de la tierra! Wananchi </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">wa</Text>
      <Text> dunia! </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Font="Sans Mono CJK Final Draft">地球上的公民们</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="41f9eac7-f445-4e03-9c5c-1a2dc2fc5b50">
      <Text>The wait is over! From the Andes to the Arctic, five billion souls are logged in! Twenty minutes until the High Noon harvest at the Gravity-Well!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6465bbad-dd0c-4557-9c93-d2480ba98f9f">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Font="Sans Mono CJK Final Draft">黄金周年大賽即將開始</Text>
      <Text Font="Sans Mono CJK Final Draft">! </Text>
      <Text>Jubilee </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">inaanza</Text>
      <Text> </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">hivi</Text>
      <Text> </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">karibuni</Text>
      <Text>! La </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">competición</Text>
      <Text> </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">comienza</Text>
      <Text> pronto! </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c96cf9a3-4994-4c8d-aa8f-00b7bd6d9bee">
      <Text>A rhythmic ping echoes. A scrolling red text appears on a cracked monitor: Message from CEO: PRIMARY ASSET STABILIZATION REQUIRED. DO NOT FAIL THE BRAND. Jaca frantically checks the monitor.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="08830fa7-52d6-43b1-a4e8-8a69f2b83002">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7e06aa7a-1de3-4bfb-a631-77f3bb59faa9">
      <Text>Gobi, the CEO is in the feed. They say if the density isn't a perfect 1.0 when the clock hits twelve, they’ll initiate a </Text>
      <Text Style="Italic">Global Reset</Text>
      <Text>. They’ll shut our oxygen-scrubbers and let the world watch us drift.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b6dafc6d-1430-4703-929a-dc53ce8050a8">
      <Text>Gobi leans against the greasy vat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="49ae5270-b02e-4ee6-8c6a-441dfbc9d48b">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5b2885f9-460d-45ac-b41c-6c17227a2193">
      <Text>Let them shut the air. Tell them the world didn't tune in for a sanitized product. They tuned in to see if the "Cloud" has a heartbeat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ebc30087-3ab8-4e66-a724-d85f703fe6a4">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0f74ffab-2484-4d99-b91a-010e50fab3b8">
      <Text>Your heart rate is 120. We’re twenty minutes out. If we don’t un-tether you by the time the competition starts, the acoustic fields will invert. You’ll be seared into the burger before the first customer bites.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="858ab61a-db8d-46a2-99fa-5d0386d00792">
      <Text>Gobi holds a metal spatula.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e33263e4-835d-4086-bca0-f6bba75a5f3f">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="66bfdd05-4c5d-4a0a-94b6-48d999101680">
      <Text>Then at least it’ll be a meal the world finally feels.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8f8df155-70a5-4618-9428-6cd223fe2c41">
      <Text>The timer on the cracked monitor hits 15:00. A violent shudder rocks the stand, the Foundry’s docking clamps engaging. Outside, a massive cargo ship occludes the sun, plunging the stand into a strobing, industrial indigo.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="805d942d-5921-49e5-b7aa-093cf7b6ba95">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f4d21dc9-e19c-4bda-b746-2936975fe6e8">
      <Text>The density is hitting 1.5! Gobi, the CEO is spiking the levitation frequencies from the command deck. They’re trying to force a Standardized Disc shape. They want a flat, stackable, corporate-approved circle. They’re trying to crush your rhythm!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="db3151d2-0bd0-40d4-8e99-b32c68a5258a">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="49a023be-9771-4c9a-8754-d502768f3d13">
      <Text>Tell them... tell them a heart doesn't have a standard shape! I’m pushing back!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="005f76b0-4a9d-4738-8fd5-3dd23b311aaf">
      <Text>(to the vat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c8ea56e2-51ac-4fd7-aca1-66bae6ab259a">
      <Text>Hold, you bastard. Hold.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e72c37aa-68ab-4d81-95b0-d1aa000d17aa">
      <Text>Jaca frantically swipes at the flickering monitor.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="68dc9f64-88c2-4253-b532-6392db039697">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="42ecc868-6697-4cee-a407-97d648c3758b">
      <Text>I’m seeing a data-collision! The CEO is flooding the nutrient valves with soy-stabilizers. They’re trying to mask your biometric signature before the judges’ sensors lock on. They want a clean product, Gobi! A silent product!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="21e5704e-8faf-47e9-9bc3-8ffbdbaac8a3">
      <Text>The monitor flickers. The CEO echoes through the station.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="-0.10" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.00" RightIndent="5.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Parenthetical" id="37e33349-3b33-4ce1-ad5e-7efe4ee70d3a">
      <Text>CEO (V.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4a1a2190-fc93-4207-8c04-d0bd01ddb352">
      <Text>Attention vendors. Deviation from branded geometry is a breach of contract. Stand down. Let the cloud be meatless and weightless. Do not contaminate the harvest with your individuality.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c6275928-71e0-4ae0-9bc4-f1ccf717b3c8">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="563e76c7-edfc-48de-8d32-2e1bc2b7777e">
      <Text>Contaminate? I’m the only thing in this tank that isn't a lie! You want a "Weightless" burger? Then why does the world feel so heavy, Boss?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b844983e-a53b-45d2-89be-544a5cb6e676">
      <Text>Jaca checks Gobi’s vitals on a handheld.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ab950573-6208-457a-ba7c-561583ac98be">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="261d67b3-ee17-4e8f-ab28-795f9af378be">
      <Text>Gobi, stop. Your blood pressure is hitting the stroke-zone. You’re becoming the grill!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9dc9f830-512d-4518-b4ad-cf27195246be">
      <Text>ANNOUNCER (V.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5a7cc58b-b895-4757-8d22-2f9c0ac64726">
      <Text>Ten minutes to the High Noon Harvest. Des minutes </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">jusqa</Text>
      <Text> la </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">recolte</Text>
      <Text>! Diez </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">minutos</Text>
      <Text> para la </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">cosecha</Text>
      <Text>! Citizens, are you ready to taste the future?!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e347a587-fee3-40b0-9ebc-59318c7d2128">
      <Text>Gobi slumps against the greasy glass, their forehead touching the warm vat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="90e01737-bb1c-4a00-9dbd-ca050103caa0">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ccebf6dc-b4d0-4a2c-ac14-4ad8ed5d58b0">
      <Text>Ten minutes... Jaca. Don't let them... un-link us. If they kill the signal... they kill the truth.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c4f12af5-3581-448c-bfe0-b688535c1d66">
      <Text>A moment of hesitation, then a decisive movement. They rip a bundle of wires from the neon sign and jam them into the vat's power port.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7492aacc-1129-4047-af56-d6ddc52b89e9">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="09d46391-da53-4eaa-9dee-48cef3053a91">
      <Text>I’m slaving the stand’s main oxygen-scrubbers to the vat’s cooling system. If the CEO tries to purge you, they’ll have to suffocate the whole orbital deck to do it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5aee938e-0dfb-4ae0-b86f-141d83aae351">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4d63d2d8-5fac-4d2a-aa04-cc420d30eb4c">
      <Text>Now that’s... some aggressive street-food.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9eddf462-562d-44da-92ff-b400557d205a">
      <Text>The flickering neon sign "BONELESS" surges with blinding light. The thumping of the heartbeat doubles in volume, shaking the very air in the orbital kitchen as the countdown hits the final 09:59.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="939b5324-3862-450d-af69-dc10282ba73b">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="87940e5e-cfa2-4c72-bd2f-539769a2268d">
      <Text>Now that’s... some aggressive street-food.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="749c7589-5ab6-4f71-8743-043cbfb4b98b">
      <Text>Jaca struggles to keep their footing as the station’s vibration intensifies.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3458f700-0d04-49a7-b14f-139ffca635a4">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e7b19893-065f-4ef5-a997-633d144332ba">
      <Text>The feedback loop is tightening, Gobi! Your pulse is feeding the thermal coils. The vat is hitting five hundred degrees. If we don’t vent the nitrogen, we’re gonna be the first meal to supernova in low earth orbit!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="098c1ed5-a8dc-4bf1-8aaa-9bf63e7de991">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="87404311-9cd6-44d1-a01f-17d28f353dc1">
      <Text>Let it burn! The 2013-spec was never about being cool. It was about the fire! It was about the day we decided to stop being predators and started being architects. Feel that? That’s not a malfunction. That’s the weight of the conscience hitting the grill!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2fb5675d-34b4-43af-ab47-05791556710e">
      <Text>ANNOUNCER (V.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="660f93cd-ff73-4541-97b5-4e22e33ded23">
      <Text>Eight minutes to harvest! </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Valo</Text>
      <Text> </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">lazima</Text>
      <Text>! The gravity well is turning into a star! Viewership now six billion! The world is holding its breath!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6644829e-beb4-47dd-b82f-bfffa373b489">
      <Text>Jaca frantically rewires a bypassed sensor.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9cecdd9f-bf94-4e85-bfc1-e04a8d3c80e8">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4c66ef14-5cf4-489f-b4c1-979c3c36af0c">
      <Text>The CEO is attempting a "Biometric Scrub"! They’re trying to digitalize your pulse out of the broadcast signal! They want the world to see the burger, but they’re trying to erase the man behind the curtain!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="df51a186-3742-4804-badf-2ef2480a111d">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="756b6710-c82b-4b8d-afce-361e7126fde5">
      <Text>They can’t erase the heat, Jaca! They can’t scrub the smell of a real sear!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2acf59a5-a632-4ee4-9f3c-75d4043a2908">
      <Text>A red alert light begins to strobe from the ceiling. A siren, low and industrial, begins to wail.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ead18b32-bc3b-4039-8747-8ee9988ee826">
      <Text>Jaca checks the monitor.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4f03c2e3-fd46-4717-b2dc-8dba199a3feb">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="43877fcb-5920-4280-a1da-6a42f6903564">
      <Text>They’ve given up on the scrub, Gobi. They’re going for a total blackout.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="90d5c173-628f-43e7-bc82-620d1d89fa43">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="900e6cca-c5e6-4b2c-9599-5931c83488db">
      <Text>What?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="894fb5f9-d02f-4f03-a403-9bb4bfd5ded2">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2a9e0284-61ae-400b-b075-73f444bf5ccb">
      <Text>The CEO is initiating a "Fire Wall Purge"! They're cutting the power to the external stalls! They'd rather have us drift into the graveyard orbit than let the Judges taste a heartbeat!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4808eac4-ba67-480d-9698-bc62f36efae5">
      <Text>The indigo light of the station is replaced by a sickly red. The hum has heavy thumps of the vat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="025c3205-6274-42d8-93b5-386424cef2de">
      <Text>Gobi gasps for air as the atmospheric pressure begins to drop.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ca446f9e-50c5-4b0c-8d73-6e4a00fbe36c">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="93d9f1d5-2b1d-4553-bbb2-9882a8ba9f10">
      <Text>They’re... they’re actually doing it. They’re dumping... the oxygen.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f36f1130-4eb4-4ee7-885f-3300a0bdd1d5">
      <Text>Jaca fumbles with an emergency respirator.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0e6fadf3-057c-46c1-9986-885eaaeb80d4">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="053ceacf-5cf9-4387-898b-51a38cd05250">
      <Text>It’s not... about the meat or bone anymore, Gobi. It’s about the... the precedent. If they let a "Heartbeat Burger" hit the feed, the whole... Cloud market... collapses. They’d rather we be... martyrs of a “technical glitch” than champions of the truth.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8df8c802-f1df-4f3a-b7e7-a7cca7389085">
      <Text>ANNOUNCER (V.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="-0.10" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.00" RightIndent="5.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Parenthetical" id="caa26638-406d-441d-9576-c9a5f7744ffa">
      <Text>(Distorted)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="91565f1e-50f5-4cd6-9e38-a6c5a1efcb9d">
      <Text>Si-</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">si</Text>
      <Text>-six minutes remain. We are experiencing signal interference... from the orbital grid. Stand by, citizens! The cloud is... persisting-</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2772a590-cd35-4943-8fd8-a835f508bb1a">
      <Text>Gobi clutches the side of the vat, their skin appears translucent under the red strobe.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3206080f-5d68-4f1c-807c-2c32010786f0">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4c893ebe-1d30-47a3-9c8c-db7f1d1ca63b">
      <Text>Look at the... the Jumbotron, Jaca. Five billion people... are watching the lights... go out. They know. They know it’s not... a glitch.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a94de6ec-5a1b-4b8d-8347-8f939da5043a">
      <Text>Jaca tries to fit the respirator over Gobi’s face.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="620d498c-baf6-438a-98bb-b2b10a06f7ed">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="363502f7-a06a-4eb2-ae22-25d846f342f9">
      <Text>Put this on! If you... flatline now... the levitation... it dies! The harvest... it’ll be a puddle!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="65e186c1-0d70-4f8f-b4f5-0e0f790fc429">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="cd9b6fbb-c3d3-4d30-aa61-c1014d636230">
      <Text>No. If I... put that on... my pulse... slows down. The sear... it needs the adrenaline. It needs the... the friction. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="b8083f26-65dc-435a-8128-92e7bb3a0a8b">
      <Text>(to the monitor)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="cd9b6fbb-c3d3-4d30-aa61-c1014d636230">
      <Text>You want to... starve us, Boss? Fine. But we’re... taking the sun... with us.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="34c3a16c-6986-4de6-ba78-8786a218b57e">
      <Text>Jaca looks at the 2013 London  readout, which is now glowing gold.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="83e4a819-e905-4cc1-b27a-db0fa5c2d460">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="55da7af1-333d-40de-8389-1c00caa75bcc">
      <Text>It’s... it’s over-calcifying. Gobi, the bone-lattice is... it’s becoming a diamond. It’s too heavy for the magnets!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="55d81ce4-d9ee-4679-8215-65761889a4aa">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="eb3942a7-6bc7-4a77-b234-9cee8d158b89">
      <Text>Then... let it... fall.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ec465c7b-8a88-4582-86b4-0647e80df017">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="dc67232e-f326-41ae-868a-3dd8ff5dbafc">
      <Text>The CEO is initiating a "Fire Wall Purge"! They’re cutting the power to the external stalls! They’d rather have us drift into the graveyard orbit than let the Judges taste a heartbeat!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9c41caba-0f1b-4d59-98c0-d62bab204895">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="541057ad-6b82-4385-a5b0-b985d87da433">
      <Text>Then... we give them... the weight. Jaca... bypass the acoustic leveling. Let the gravity-well take it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a0886d72-3cbc-461c-9a6d-5ddbe076e9a7">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4369ed29-b9f3-4216-adb2-77a3647b0f0f">
      <Text>If I cut the leveling, the mass will hit the grill at three </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Gs</Text>
      <Text>! It’ll shatter the glass, Gobi! We’re in a pressurized tube!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="caf3a2b0-c386-4004-a83d-563cda98f0dd">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8c79fecc-90e5-4a8b-9cfa-64679b097faf">
      <Text>Let it shatter! The world needs to hear the impact! Trust the bone! Trust the 2023-spec! Do it!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b5776372-4461-46ce-a306-e7e0a9b30f3b">
      <Text>The timer hits 5:00. The sun emerges from behind a cargo ship, casting a glare that creates a halo effect with the steam. The Cloud Protein in the vat is a thick, irregular monument of seared marrow, pulsing with light.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="112b21f3-51a7-4809-a130-ff7ad90219dc">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="38155761-4d48-4c62-a1ff-bfba0e7b8522">
      <Text>The CEO is initiating a grilling purge! They’re cutting the power to the external stalls! They’d rather have us drift into the graveyard orbit than let the Judges taste a heartbeat!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a776f0b1-feae-4c33-b1ff-87eb2c00cdfe">
      <Text>Gobi gasps, clutching the counter.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c9734e11-85d5-4cad-add2-1769378ba454">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ea32421e-bcea-43e2-8de7-7badd7acc9f5">
      <Text>Then... we give them... the weight. Jaca... bypass the acoustic leveling. Let the Gravity  Well take it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3aa09995-4ae0-4422-9e40-b1f87db00717">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f482c9e6-47af-467a-a612-bb76264cb8d5">
      <Text>If I cut the leveling, the mass will hit the grill at three </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Gs</Text>
      <Text>! It’ll shatter the glass, Gobi! We’re in a pressurized tube!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7037dbe0-1363-4fd9-89e1-e32ea6469da3">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f3896988-f762-4894-ac74-5798c6e6aed8">
      <Text>Let it shatter! The world needs to hear the impact! Trust the bone! Trust 2023! Do it!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="cee97a94-d368-473c-b341-04aad4c1192d">
      <Text>Jaca slams the emergency release. A CRACK echoes as the glass of the vat shatters. Instead of drifting, this Cloud Protein drops with a visceral BEAT onto the plate. A cloud of steam fills the stand.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a0197f70-5303-4b7a-ae17-d8310cb5653c">
      <Text>ANNOUNCER (V.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b58986c0-026d-4cb2-9f71-507b832411f6">
      <Text>Unexpected impact! The biomass has landed. La </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">recolte</Text>
      <Text> a </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">atterri</Text>
      <Text>! The harvest is... solid as a skeleton!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="cd437006-2e3a-4ac5-a867-cbd8fcea38d0">
      <Text>CEO (V.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ce182fc6-115b-4c34-b65d-908276e4f78d">
      <Text>Vendors, Gobi and Jaca. Your lease has been terminated. Your assets will be purged.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b7c2eb35-ef83-42c4-b9d6-b2da899631bd">
      <Text>Gobi slumps to the floor. Their lungs burn while laughing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="fd98c0fc-7fe2-442a-92da-2c13e7994bda">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="babd0f6e-b247-4896-a9be-d2b1c9236a28">
      <Text>Terminate... whatever you want. We’re live... on every screen... in the sky.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6975a489-f555-48be-90a2-e33942e18fcd">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="83721e5f-9447-4cc2-bdbe-39ff0d0b5032">
      <Text>We’re not eye-less...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ab7602f0-060f-41a9-b744-c7a78dee19eb">
      <Text>ANNOUNCER (V.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="09300de9-31d9-4615-af2a-cfbc3befc060">
      <Text>It’s noon! C est midi! Es </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">mediodia</Text>
      <Text>! Citizens of Earth... The Gravity Well has served! The golden burger has their heartbeat!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9b49396b-2912-4e23-8f23-56231e8295aa">
      <Text>The Jumbotron snaps to a close-up of the burger. It is charred, heavy, and leaking real, crimson-amber juice onto the dented chrome. Gobi and Jaca are silhouetted against the blinding curve of the Earth, two street-vendors who finally gave the future a spine.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e73075bd-a880-4693-a8b2-47c4d64d8172">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="11f53574-794e-4e5b-98a1-fc4dbd1409eb">
      <Text>They're eating it, Gobi. Look at the pings. Five billion people... just realized they're hungry.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="349ac7e5-73e7-423a-b023-becd75f7e284">
      <Text>GOBI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5006103c-07f4-45a3-9b53-f9820459e626">
      <Text>Let them eat. At least... they'll finally know how a meal feels.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e43f0486-c13b-440d-832d-cd1fef8a637b">
      <Text>JACA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f02e18ce-a364-4dd0-ac95-ca4a6d081705">
      <Text>They’ll never know that it was called a whopper.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c1985aae-081e-438a-9bec-0e4878c8e713">
      <Text>The flickering "BONELESS" sign gives a triumphant spark and dies. The lights in the stand fade to the glow of the Earth below. Jaca and Gobi sit in the silence of the void, tethered to nothing but each other.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Center" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.50" RightIndent="7.50" SpaceBefore="24" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="End of Act" id="a3172081-1aa2-4f43-8d7a-8ffcbf054f4c">
      <Text Style="Underline+AllCaps">End of Play</Text>
    </Paragraph>
  </Content>

